<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Bible Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu kásonika Luka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakidisitu ba theti bátambwasa mu kuzimbula ni Luka yi yandi musoniki wa Musamu wa Bukheti wa Luka yi mukanda wa Bisalu bya bathumwa. Básonikawa ku thwala Bisalu bya Bathumwa (Mhb 1,1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yandi, munganga kákala yi nduku wa kisalu wa Pholu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka kákala mosi wa bana bakonda kala Bayuta, mwisi Atyosi, amana yandi kátambwasa malongi ma bathumwa ba Yesu ku thwala kusala kisalu kyandi yi thumwa Pholu. Homa hana kakala yi mvula yina kásonika mukanda wawu bizayakaniku mboti-mboti. Mukuma Luka wákangala nzila za lawu za kaleyi ha kimosi yi Pholu, batu balonguka balawu bisi zonza ni ngatu ku Loma kakala, bwosu bisi banzila phi ni ngatu kwakuna kásonikina mukanda wa Bisalu bya bathumwa. Batu balonguka, balawu bisi banza ni Musamu wa Bukheti wawu básonikawa mu luyanduku lwa mvula za makumi sambanu (60) holo ku thwala mvula meni zina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka kásonika mukanda wawu kikuma kya biwutu byandi bana bakonda kala Bayuta yi kikuma kya Bayuta. Yi bawu phi báyukawa lawu kwena baphani bwosu: Mu kuzonzila mambu matadi Lubutuku lwa Yesu, Luka kabati bonga mbandu kwena bapfumu ba Loma (2:1) yi luyanduku lwa kisalu kya Yowani Mubotiki (3:1); Wukyatiki butuka dya Yesu tuka kwa Atamu (3:23-38) yi kima kibati songila ni Yesu kena kiwutu kya tsi yosu; Luka kásonika mukanda wawu mu mihowu mina bisi sadila baphani, hanga: "mulongi". Mbatanana kásonikawa kikuma kya baphani kaasi malongi mena muna kati matadi batu bana bisi tela ni ba Thyofila, disongidila: batu bana batomi zola Nzambi holo bana kazodi Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kisina kya mbuta kya Luka kizimbudi ni Nzambi mu khenda zandi (1,50, 54, 72, 78), wátuma Yesu ndangu kisa sosa yi kuhulula batu bana bátota (19:10).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kati dya mukanda wawu, mwena yi mambu mahika mana tufwani twamona phi hanga mu mukanda wa Mathayi yi wuna wa Malaku; bwosu tufwani twatanga mambu matadidi Yowani Mubotiki; kumekama kwa Yesu ku tseki ya kisombi; luzingu lwa Yesu ku Ngadidi; Mihangu mya Yesu ku mbanza Yelusalemi; Mukinzi wa Phaki, lufwa lwa Yesu ha kitakani, kufutumuka kwandi yi kudimonikisa kwandi kwena balonguki yi kwena batu bahika yi kutombuka kwandi ku zilu. Hena yi mambu mahika kásonika Luka, makondi kala mu mikanda mya hika hanga: Yesu ku nzu ya Malata yi Madiya baphangi ba Lasalu (10, 38-42); Mukhenda wa Mwisi Samadiya wa bukheti (10, 29-37); Mukhenda wa Mwana wa vila (15, 11-32).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Luka wawu wuzonzi phi ni Yesu kenina kikuma kya batu boosu. Kikuma kya yandi, Yesu kisa kikuma kya batu babana bakonda kala Bayuta yi kikuma kya Bayuta, basumuki yi batu basungama, batsukạmi yi bamvwama.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kulanda yi masingitini mukanda wawu, Luka kabati musongila Mwana mutu hanga muhuludi wa batu boosu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Khotidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>
    <note caller="a" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mukanda wawu, Luka kásonikawa mu zina dya mukidisitu mosi wa luzitu, Thyofila, yi kikuma kya bakidisitu bahika. </char>
    </note>Muzitu Thyofila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Batu ba lawu bámeka kusonika meni dya mambu mana máluta ha kati kya betu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Básonikama bwosu bátuzimbwala betu, batu bana bámona mambu mana yi mesu ma thona tuka ku luyandiku, amana phi babana basadi ba ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Ihana ni kwena meni phi, phyudiki bwa bukheti, <note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku nima dya kulonguka mambu moosu tuka ku luyanduku. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Khaphu zodi za theti za Musamu wa Bukheti wawu, zibati zonzila lubutuku lwa Yowani mubotiki yi lubutuku lwa Yesu. </char></note>meni dina dyosu, buna dyálutila, tuka ku luyandiku yi kuna tsuka, ihana mbonibwa bwa bukheti mu kukusonikina ngeyi muzitu Thyofila, <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>tsadibwa ndangu wazaya hika tsikiningi ya malongi mana wátambula.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanzyo wusamuni lubutuku lwa Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Tangwa dina, Eloti kákala pfumu wa mulambu wa Yuteya. Kwákala yi nganga Nzambi mosi, khumbu yandi Zakadiya, wuna wákala mu mukanzu wa Abiya. Mukhetu wandi kakala mosi muna butuka dya Loni, yi mbuta wa theti, wa banganga Nzambi, bakala tela: Dizebeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Bákala bawu bodi batu basungama ku thwala ya Nzambi, bakala lemvuka phi buna bufwani ku mitsiku yi malongi moosu ma Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/><note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dizebeti kisita kákala. Bwosu bakala Sala mukhetu wa Bulahami yi Lebeka mukhetu wa Kizaki yi Lakhedi, bakhaka ba bana ba Kiseledi holo bwosu kakala Ana ngudi wa mbikudi Samwela. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mbala za hika kisita kina kibati songila khenda za Nzambi kwena batu bana badikulumuna yi bana bisi lewula. </char></note>Kaasi bákalaku yi mwana, mukuma Dizebeti kisita kákala, amana bawu bodi phi binunu bákala.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Kilumbu kimosi, Zakadiya kakala sala bisalu byandi bya kinganga ku thwala ya Nzambi mukuma dyákala tangwa dya mukanzu wa yandi mu kusalakya. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Bwosu yákala tsadidi ya banganga Nzambi, hanga babetini zeki mu kumusola ndangu kakota mu kikumbu kya Nzambi, kayoka phi pfwabidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wosu wakala lombila ku phenza, mu tangwa dya kuyoka pfwabidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Hanga wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wumulubwakidi Zakadiya: wutelamiki kuna lweka lwa kitata lwa mesa mana ma kuyokila pfwabidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakadiya buna kamúmona, hanga mabanza mamuvwalangani, bweya bumukwatini. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Kaasi wanzyo wumuzimbwadi: «Yukaku bweya, Zakadiya, mukuma Nzambi wuyuki lombilu lwaku: mukhetu waku, Dizebeti, mwana wa yakala kakúbutila; wamúheka khumbu, Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Kakála tho ya kyesi kya lawu yi tsambu kikuma kya ngeyi, amana batu balawu phi basángwala kikuma kya lubutuku lwandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Mukuma yandi kakála mutu wa mbuta ku thwala ya Pfumu. Kanwikiku vinu keti malafu ma kufundika lo. Kakála wabasa yi Kitembu kyatoma tuka mu vumu dya ngudi wandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Kavútula batu ba lawu ba Kiseledi kwena Pfumu Nzambi wa bawu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wanzyo watekila zonza buna kyakala kisalu kya Yowani mwana wa Zakadiya. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Batu babakula ni mbikudi Diya wuna watombuka ku zilu mu zanga dya mbawu kakwisa vutuka hika ha tsi mu kuyidika kukwisa kwa Yesu. </char></note>Kakwísa hanga mbambala wa Nzambi yi kitembu yi ngolu hanga mbikudi Diya, kikuma kya kukhundikisa batata yi bana ba bawu amana kasádisa batu bana báhakuka, mu kutambula ngangu za batu basungama; ndangu kayidika kikanda kya batu kina kyáyilama kikuma kya Pfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Kaasi Zakadiya wuzonzi kwena wanzyo: «Abweti yizáyila ni mambu mana menina ma kyedika? Mukuma meni yekina mbuta, mukhetu wama phi wekina mbuta.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Wanzyo wumuvutwadi: «Meni yenina Ngabudyela; wuna wisi telama ku thwala ya Nzambi mu kumusadila; yandi kathumini ndangu yikuzimbwala amana yikunatina Musamu wa Bukheti wawu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Kaasi ngeyi, wukwikidiku mu ndinga za meni zina zakwísa lungila mu tangwa dyandi; ihana ni kamama wakítuka, kilumbu yikuna malúngila mambu mama.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, batu bakala hingila Zakadiya, hanga bekayituka bwosu kázingidila mu kati dya kikumbu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Kaasi ha kálubuka, kálendaku kubazonzisa amana batu babakisa ni mbona mesu kámoni mu kikumbu. Kakala basongila mu bidimbu, kuna yandi mutu, wusadi kamama.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Ha kámanisa, Zakadiya, tangwa dyandi dina kafwana kasala bisalu mu nzu ya Nzambi, hanga wuvutuki ku nzu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Kunima dya matangwa, mukhetu wandi Dizebeti wáyimita vumu amana wuswami ngonda tanu muna nzu. Wudizonzidi yandi meni ni <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Tala mambu kasadi Pfumu kikuma kya meni: buthwena, wutambwasini kukhutumuna mu dyambu dina dyakala pheka tsoni ku mesu ma batu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanzyo mosi wusamuni lubutuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Muna ngonda ya sambanu, Nzambi wáhitika wanzyo Ngabudyela muna mbanza mosi ya Ngadidi, khumbu ya yawu Nazaleti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>kwena ndumba wa mukhetu mosi bázitikila mu kimbayi kwena yakala mosi bakala tela Yozefu. Mutu yandu kákala mosi muna butuka dya kyamvu Tavidi. Khumbu ya ndumba wa mukhetu wuna Madiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Wanzyo wákota muna nzu yandi, wumuzimbwadi phi: «Mboti Madiya! Pfumu wukusadidi mamboti ma lawu, yandi kenina yi ngeyi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Madiya buna káyuka mambu mana, wekina yangalakanu; wekadihyula thendula ya mboti meni yina. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Hanga wanzyo wumuzimbwadini: «Tekitaku<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Tekitaku" disongidila: "Madiya, wuyukaku bweya, holo wubangaku. </char></note>, Madiya, mukuma Nzambi wukusadidi mambu ma bukheti. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Ka thama ku, vumu wayímita, wabúta mwana mosi wa yakala amana wamúheka khumbu, Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Kakála mutu wa mbuta amana bamútela ni mwana wa Nzambi wa Phungu wuluti. Pfumu Nzambi kamúheka, yandi, kiti kya kipfumu kya khaka wandi Tavidi <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>amana yandi, kayadiki mu matangwa moosu muna kikanda kya Yakobi, kipfumu kyandi kyakálaku yi tsuka.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/><note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzayiku kedi yakala. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Nzayiku lutu lwa mutu wa yakala. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Yina yena nzonzidi ya ba Hebelu. </char></note>Madiya wuhyudini kwena wanzyo: «Abweti mahángamina, mambu mana kikuma meni, nzayiku kedi yakala?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Wanzyo wumuvutwadini: «Kitembu Kyatoma kakúkulumukina amana ngolu za Nzambi wa Phungu wuluti zakúfidinga hanga kivula. Ihana ni Mwana wuna wabútuka, bamútediki: watoma, Mwana wa Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Kiwutu kyaku Dizebeti, yandi phi ku vumu kenina, mwana wa yakala kabúta, mbatanana kinunu; yandi wuna bakala tela ni kisita, buthwena, vumu dilungisini ngonda sambanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Mukuma heku kima kyakonda lendakana kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Hanga Madiya wuzimbudini: «Meni, yenina musadi wa Pfumu; yambula moosu malungila kikuma kya meni, bwosu wuzimbudibwa.» Amana wanzyo wumusisi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Madiya wendi tala Dizebeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Muna bilumbu byálanda, Madiya wubwi mu nzila wendi tswasu ku malondi ma Yuteya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Wákota muna nzu ya Zakadiya amana wámuheka Dizebeti mboti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Muna tangwa meni dina káyuka, yandu, mboti ya Madiya, mwana wuzatukini muna vumu dyandi. Dizebeti kákala wabasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>amana wuzimbudi mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Nzambi wukusakumuni kuluta bakhetu boosu, mwana wuna wabúta phi kenina wa kusakumuna. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Nani yenina meni ndangu, ngudi wa Pfumu wama, kisa thala? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Mukuma, tala, muna tangwa meni dina ngyukiki mboti yaku, mwana wuningani mu kyesi muna kati dya meni. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Mu kyedika, mu kyesi wenina, mukuma wukwikidini mambu mana kazonzikini Pfumu kikuma kya ngeyi ni malúngila.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunga wa Madiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Hanga Madiya wuzonzi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Yibati mutsikisa Pfumu yi mbundu yama yosu, kikuma kenina wa mbuta,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Moya wama, wenina wabasa yi kyesi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">kikuma kya Nzambi muhuludi wama;<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Mukuma wuthadi meni musadi wandi wadikulumuna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Yi bwabuna ni, tuka lelu, batu boosu bayándika kuthela ni mukwa kyesi,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>mukuma Nzambi mukwa ngolu zoosu wutsadidi mambu ma mbuta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Khumbu yandi yenina yatoma,<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>matangwa moosu kisi songila khenda zandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">kwena batu bana bisi muzitisa.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Wusongidi ngolu za koku dyandi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">wukudi batu bana benina yi mbundu za lulendu,<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Wubakatudi bapfumu mu biti bya bawu bya kipfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">amana wubahingisi kwena batu badikulumuna bakala mu ndonga ya theti.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Wuhani mamboti ma lawu kwena batu bana bakala mawu nzala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">amana wubakukwasi bamvwama moku ma khatu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Wisa yakidila kikanda kya Kiseledi, musadi wandi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">kázimbakanaku mu kusongila khenda zandi<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>kwena Bulahami yi kikanda kyandi, mu matangwa moosu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">bwosu kásila kwena bakhaka betu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Madiya wánanga yi Dizebeti, ngonda tatu, ku nima wávutuka kuhata dyandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubutuku lwa Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Ha dyálunga tangwa dya kubuta, Dizebeti wábuta mwana wa yakala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Bakwa mukombu wandi yi biwutu byandi bu bayuka ni Pfumu, wumusongidi khenda zandi mu mambu ma mbuta, ma bukheti kamusadidini, básangwala lawu ha kimosi yi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Kilumbu kya nana ha kyálunga, ku nima lubutuku, bisa ndangu bamukotisa mwana mukhanda; bazodi bamuheka khumbu ya tata wandi Zakadiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Kaasi ngudi wandi, kuna kákala, wuzimbudi: «Loni, khumbu yandi yakála Yowani.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Bawu bamuvutwadini: «Muna kikanda kyaku mweku mutu wenina yi khumbu yina!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Hanga bahyudi, mu bidimbu, kwena tata keti khi khumbu kazodi bamuheka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakadiya wálomba dibaya wusonikini: «Khumbu yandi Yowani.» Batu boosu báyituka. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Zakadiya wávutukila kuzonza: wekamukumisa Nzambi mu ndinga ya ngolu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Bakwa mukombu boosu báyuka bweya amana mu kinzunga kina kyosu kya malondi ma Yuteya, báyandika kudimenika mambu mana másalama. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Batu boosu bana bakalama yuka, báyandika kuyindula muna mbundu ya bawu yi kudihyulaka: «Buthwena bwabu, nani kakwisa kituka mwana meni yandu?» Mu kyedika ngolu za Pfumu, wakala zawu mwana wuna.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunga wa Zakadiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakadiya, tata wa mwana meni yandu, kakala wabasa yi Kitembu Kyatoma; wáyandika kubikula bwabu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Lukumu kwena Pfumu, Nzambi wa kikanda kya Kiseledi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">mukuma yandi kisa, ndangu kayakidila kikanda kyandi amana kahululakya phi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Kahangi wisi lubula Muhuludi wa ngolu kikuma kya betu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">mu kati kya kikanda kya kyamvu Tavidi, musadi wandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Mamana katekila zonza kwena bambikudi bandi ba Nzambi:<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>luhulusu lumosi lwisi tukatula kwena bambeni betu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">yi mu luyalu lwa batu bana bisi tumenga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Wásongila kyadi kyandi kwena bakhaka betu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">amana kázimbakanaku kuyukana kwandi kwatoma.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Ihana ni Nzambi wázenga ndefi kwena Bulahami, tata wetu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>ni wátuhulula mu luyalu lwa bambeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">ndangu twamusadila konda bweya,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>ndangu twalenga kala batu ba Nzambi yi batu ba masonga ku thwala yandi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">mu bilumbu byosu bya luzingu lwetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Amana kwena ngeyi mwana wama, bakutediki ni mbikudi wa Nzambi wa Phungu wuluti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mukuma wahíta ku thwala Pfumu mu kwenda muyidikila nzila<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>yi kusamuna kwena kikanda kyandi ni wisi bahulula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">mu kubalolula masumu ma bawu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Nzambi wa betu, wabasa yi lungongu yi kyadi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">katúkenzula mu mwini wandi wuna wisi tuka ku zilu bwosu kisi lubuka tangwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Kikuma kya kukenzula baba benina mu phipa yi mu kivula kya lufwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">mu kutwadisa bitambi byetu mu nzila ya ngemba.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwana kakala kola, kakala phi ngolu mu kitembu. Kakala zingila mu nganga tii yi kuna kilumbu kina kisa disongila kwena batu ba kikanda kya Kiseledi.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Lubutuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mth 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, pfumu wa mbuta wa mulambu wa Loma, Khayisala<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku kisina, Khayisala yakala khumbu ya mutu, kaasi ku manima bayandika kusadilaya hanga khumbu ya «mwata-yamvu», bwosu bazonzidiya haka: «mwata-yamvu wa Loma» </char></note> Okisiti, káhanga wulubudi mutsiku ni batu boosu benda disonikisa khumbu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Yi mbala ya theti ya kusonikisa khumbu, yásalama mu tangwa meni dina kákala Kidinwusi pfumu wa mukombu wa Sidiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Amana batu boosu bákala kwenda mu kudisonikisa khumbu, kosu mutu, kuna mbanza yandi ya kisina. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yozefu, yandi phi, wutuki ku Nazaleti, mbanza ya Ngadidi, wendi ku Betelemi, mbanza yimosi ya Yuteya, kuna kábutwakila kyamvu Tavidi; mukuma yandi phi kákala mu kikanda kya Tavidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Kenda disonikisa khumbu yi mbayi wandi, Madiya, wákala ku kifundu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Muna tangwa medina bákala ku Betelemi, hanga kilumbu kya kubuta kifwani. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Madiya wubuti mwana wandi wa yakala, mwana wandi wa theti; wumuvungi ha miledi, wumunimbiki muna bangwa dina bidila bambisi, kikuma mwákalaku kizika, mu nzu ya banzenza kikuma kya bawu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanzyo wubalubwakidi bakalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Muna kinzunga mekina, mwákala yi bakalema bakala leka mu tseki, mu kukinda bibulu bya bawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wubalubwakidi, khembu ya Pfumu yibayiniki hana bákala boosu. Hanga bweya bubakwati lawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kaasi wanzyo wubasamwani: «Luyukaku bweya, mukuma Musamu wa Bukheti yilunatini, wuna wásephidisa lawu, batu boosu: <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>mu phipha ya lelu, muna mbanza ya Tavidi, mubutukidini Muhuludi kikuma kya benu; yi Kidisitu, Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Talenu bidimbu lwamúzayila: lwamóna mwana mosi wa khunda, wa kuvunga ha miledi, wa kunimbika phi muna bangwa dimosi.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Muna mbala mosi, khumbi-khumbi ya banzyo ba ku zilu, kumosi yi wuna wa theti, bakala zatula Nzambi, bakala zimbula:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Khembu kwena Nzambi muna kisoka kya mazilu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">yi ngemba hana tsi kwena batu babana kisi tonda!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakalema bendi ku Betelemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Tangwa bávutuka, banzyo, ku zilu, hanga bakalema ba mikoku bazimbudi bawu yi bawu: «Thwendenu tii yi kuna Betelemi, ndangu twamona mambu mana mabwi kuna, mana katusamwani Pfumu, twazaya.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Hanga bakinani kukwenda, bamuwani phi Madiya yi Yozefu yi mwana khunda wa kunimbika muna bangwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Tangwa bámumona, bayandiki kumenika mambu mana kábasamwana wanzyo, matadidi mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Batu boosu bana báyuka meeni dya bakalema, hanga bayituki. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Madiya, yandi, kakala zindika mambu mana moosu muna mbundu amana kakala yindula lawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Ku nima, bakalema bávutuka kwena bawu, báyandika kuzatula yi kukumisa Nzambi kikuma kya mambu mana báyuka yi mana bámona, mukuma moosu máluta bwosu kábasamwana wanzyo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamuheki Yesu khumbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Kilumbu kya nana ha kyálunga, kunima lubutuku, hanga bámukotisa mwana mukhanda, bamuheki phi khumbu ya Yesu, yina káhana wanzyo kwena Madiya, hana khaku kayimita vumu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamusakumuni mu nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Amana tangwa ha dyálungila ndangu Yozefu yi Madiya balungisa lukanu lwa kudisemisa bwosu buna myakala lomba mitsiku mya Moyize. Hanga bamunati mwana ku nzu ya Nzambi ya Yelusalemi ndangu bamutambika kwena Pfumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>kikuma básonika mu mitsiku mya Pfumu: «Mwana wosu wa yakala wa theti wabútuka, kakála watoma kikuma kya Pfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Bibuti byandi bisa tambika mukhayilu bwosu bwakala lomba mu mitsiku mya Pfumu, mbwela boodi holo phombu boodi ba matuku.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Kwákala, kuna Yelusalemi, mutu mosi khumbu yandi Simeyoni. Kákala mutu wasungama; kákala muzitisa Nzambi, kákala hingila yandi wafwana kwisa mu kuhulula Kiseledi. Kitembu Kyatoma kákala yi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Amana Kitembu Kyatoma kátekila muzimbwala ni kakhanaku fwa kedi, konda kumona Kidisitu wa Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Kitembu wumunatisi Simeyoni, wénda ku nzu ya Nzambi. Muna tangwa meni dina, bibuti bya Yesu bamunati ndangu balungisa lukanu bwosu milombini mitsiku, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeyoni wumuzangudi muna moku mandi, wuvutudi matondu kwena Nzambi mu kuzonza bwabu:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Buthwena, Pfumu, wulungisi lusilu lwaku: wufwani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">wamuyambula muhika waku kafwa mu ngemba.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Mukuma mesu mama mamoni luhulusu lwaku,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>luhulusu luna wátekila yidika ku thwala ya bikanda byosu:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>lwenina mutemu wa kuzayikisa kwena batu ba tsi yosu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">wawuna wákala lukumu lwa kikanda kyaku kya Kiseledi.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbikutulu ya Simeyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Tata yi ngudi wa Yesu báyituka mu mambu mamana kázonza Simeyoni kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeyoni wábasakumuna, wuzonzi phi kwena Madiya, ngudi wa Yesu: «Nzambi wámusola mwana yandu kikuma kya yandi, batu ba lawu bábwa, bahika phi bátombuka, mu Kiseledi. Kakala kidimbu kya Nzambi kaasi batu ba lawu bamubwisa, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>amana mabanza ma batu ba lawu máswama mu mbundu, kalúbulama ha tseki. Kwena ngeyi, Madiya, phasi za lawu wáyuka ku mbundu hanga ngumba yikutubudi mbundu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana mbikudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kwákala hika yi mbikudi mosi wa mukhetu, khumbu yandi Ana, mwana mukhetu wa Phanuwedi, mukwa kikanda kya Asidi. Wanuna kákala, kázinga yi yakala dyandi wa kingunza, mvula tsambwadi, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>ku nima, wasala mufwidi, kánanga mvula makumi nana yi ya. Kakalaku tina nzu ya Nzambi, kaasi kakala sadila Nzambi phipha yi mwini mu kuzila kudya yi mu kulombila. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Yandi phi wátula mu tangwa medina, yandiki kuvutula matondu kwena Nzambi. Wumuzonzidi mwana kwena batu boosu, bana bakala hingila ni Nzambi kahulula Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka kwa ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Tata yi ngudi wa Yesu, ha bálungisa lukanu lwosu, bwosu milombi mitsiku mya Pfumu, bávutuka yi yandi ku Ngadidi, ku mavula ma bawu ma Nazaleti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwana kakala kola yi kikesa, wábasa yi mudimu, khenda za Nzambi zákala yi yandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, mu mvula kumi yi zoodi, mu nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kosu mvula, bibuti bya Yesu bakala kwenda ku Yelusalemi kikuma kya mukinzi wa Phaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Ha kálungisa Yesu mvula kumi yi zoodi, bamunati bwosu kyákala kikalulu kya bawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Ha bamanisa kuta mukinzi, bávutuka, kaasi mwana sanda, Yesu, wásala ku Yelusalemi; bibuti byandi bázayaku. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Babanza ni Yesu kákala yi bakwawu khunda ba mu nzila, bana bakala kangala bawu amana básala kilumbu kimosi mu nzila. Hanga bayandiki kumusanda hana kati kya biwutu yi banduku ba bawu, <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Kaasi bámusengumunaku. Bávutuka hika ku Yelusalemi yi kwenda musosaka, kinzila-kinzila. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Kilumbu kya tatu, bámusenguna muna nzu ya Nzambi: wasikuka hana kati dya balongi ba mitsiku, mu kubahinikina yi mu kubahyula byufu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Batu boosu bana bakala muhinikina, bakala yituka kikuma kya ngangu zandi yi mvutu zina kakala bavutwala. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Ha bámusenguna, bibuti byandi, báyituka lawu amana ngudi wandi wumuzimbwadi: «Mwana wama, kikuma kya biki wutuhangidi bwabuna? Tataku yi meni, mu kiwayi kya lawu tukakusandila.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yandi wubavutwadini: «Kikuma kya biki lubati tsandila? Lwazayabwoku ni yifweti landila mambu ma Tata wama?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Kaasi bábakulaku mambu mana kakala bazimbwala.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yesu wákulumuka nzila mosi yi bawu ku Nazaleti. Kakala balemvukila. Ngudi wandi kakala sweka mambu mana moosu muna mbundu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Amana Yesu kakala kola yi mu mudimu yi mu malutu, kákala hana phi tsambu kwena Nzambi yi kwena batu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Yowani mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mth 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ywn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Yákala mvula ya kumi yi tanu, ya luyalu lwa Khayisala Tibela. Hana Phosi Philatu kákala muyadi wa kinzunga kya Yuteya. Eloti yandi káyala ku Ngadidi, amana phangi wandi wa yakala Fidiphu ha kinzunga kya Kitudi yi Talakonititi. Lusanyasi kakala tala kinzunga kya Abileni. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ana yi Khayifu bákala bambuta ba banganga Nzambi. Ndinga ya Nzambi yáyukalakana kwena Yowani, mwana wa yakala wa Zakadiya, muna nganga. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yowani wáyandika kukangala kinzunga kina kyosu kyatalana yi nzadi Yolutani. Weka longa mbotika ya kusoba bikalulu kikuma kya ndoluka ya masumu.<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Bwosu buna bwásonama mu mukanda wa ndinga za mbikudi Yesaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Ndinga mutu wubati bekitila muna nganga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Yidikenu nzila ya Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">musungikilenu tuma twa nzila bukheti!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Beti dyosu dyazíkama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">yi mongu yi matunda byosu byasíkunuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila zina za khonda zasúngama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila za mabulu baséngwadilaza.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Amana mutu wosu kamóna luhulusu kahána Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu bakala kwisa kwena Yowani ndangu kababotika. Kakala bazimbwala: «Mbandu ya masawa! Nati wulusongidi ni lwatina khabu za Nzambi zina zibati kwisa? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Salenu mambu ma bukheti, hanga miti wuna wisi ha bibundu bya bukheti, mu kusongila ni benu, lusobini bikalulu byenu amana ludizonzilaku: "Betu, khaka wetu Bulahami." Mukuma, yiluzimbwadibwa ni Nzambi kalenda kitula matadi mama, bana ba Bulahami! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Amana kisoka bela-bela kyenina mu kukwanga miti tuka ku misodi: miti wosu wuna wisiku buta bibundu bya bukheti bakwángawa, balosiwa phi ku mbawu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Kibuka kimuhyudi: «Amana biki fwani twahanga?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Wubavutwadi: «Wuna wenina yi miledi myodi, kakabisa yi wuna kondi muledi, mutindu mosi phi yi mutu wuna wenina yi bima bya kudya, kahanga bwabuna.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Bakalaki ba phaku bísa ndangu babotama amana bahyudi kwena Yowani: «Mulongi, biki fwani twahanga?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Yowani wubavutwadini: «Lulutulaku thalu yina bázenga kikuma kya phaku.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Baphumbulu, bawu phi bamuhyudini: «Amana betu, biki twahánga?» Wubavutwadi mvutu: «Lubwotulaku mbongu kwena mutu, keti kumuhunina musamu, kaasi tambwasenu yi kyesi lufutu lwenu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Batu boosu bakala hingila yi kivuvu kyosu, bekadihyula kuna mbundu ni ngatu Yowani, fwani kakala Masiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Hanga Yowani wubazimbwadi bawu boosu: «Meni, yibati lubotika mu mamba; kaasi wuna wisi kwisa, wuphiti meni mu ngolu: yeku walunga mu kukutumuna misinga mya tsabatu zandi. Kalubotika mu Kitembu Kyatoma yi mu mbawu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Wusimbi muyungulu muna moku mandi ndangu kasola ngenza za bukheti yi tswala. Kawóngika ngenza za bukheti, wuswekiza muna khila, kaasi, tswala, kayókaza mu mbawu yina yisiku zima.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yowani kakala basidingisa batu yi milongi mya hika mya lawu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Kaasi Yowani kakala mukaya Eloti, wuna wakala yala ku Ngadidi, kikuma wákwela Elodyadi, mukhetu wa phangi wandi wa yakala; mambu mambi ma lawu hika káhanga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Hanga Eloti wuyiki hika dyambu dimosi dya mbi lawu: wumukwatisi, mu boloku, Yowani.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotika ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mth 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Batu ba lawu bakala botama, Yesu phi wábotama. Muna tangwa medina kakala lombila, zilu dyákanguka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>amana Kitembu Kyatoma wákulumuka kwena yandi mu kimwesa mutu kya Phombu. Amana ndinga yimosi yituki ku zilu, yizonzi: «Ngeyi wenina Mwana wama watondama; mwena ngeyi mwena kyesi kyama.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndala ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mth 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Bela-bela yi mvula makumatatu Yesu káyandika kisalu kyandi. Bwosu bakala mubanzila, batu, ni mwana Yozefu; tala mulonga wa butuka dya bakhaka bandi: Hedi; <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Mathata, Lefi, Meleki, Yanayi, Yozefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Matatyasi, Amosi, Nawumi, Esidi, Nakhayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Mati, Matatyasi, Semeyini, Yoseki, Yota, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yowana, Lesa, Zolubabedi, Salasyedi, Nedi, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Mediki, Adi, Kosami, Edimatami, Elu, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Yesu, Edyezedi, Yodimi, Mathata, Lefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Simeyoni, Yuta, Yozefu, Yonami, Edyakimi <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Meleya, Mena, Mathata, Natani, Tavidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Yese, Obedi, Bozi, Sala, Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Aminatabi, Adimini, Adini, Hesiloni, Phelesi, Yuta, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yakobi, Kizaki, Bulahami, Tela, Nahodi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Seluki, Lewu, Pheleki, Hebedi, Syela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Kayinami, Alipakisati, Semi, Nowa, Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Matusalemi, Enoki, Yaleti, Maleleyedi, Kayinami, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Enosi, Seti, Atamu wuna kahanga Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Phukumunu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mth 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu, ha kálubuka mu nzadi Yolutani, wubasi yi Kitembu kyatoma, yandi wumunatisi mu nganga. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Kwakuna, kasala bilumbu makumaya, Satana wendi ndangu kamuhukumuna. Kakalaku dya keti kima, bilumbu meni byabina byosu, amana kunima nzala yimukwati. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Hanga kiphidi-mutu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiphidi-mutu disongidila zabulu. </char></note> wumuzimbwadi: «Kamba ngeyi Mwana Nzambi wena, zimbula kwena tadi dyadi dyakituka dipha!» <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Básonika mu mukanda wa Nzambi: "Mutu kazingilaku lwesi mu mapha."»<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Kiphidi-mutu wumunati ha tunda, mu tangwa dimosi, wumusongidi bipfumu bya tsi byosu, <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>amana kiphidi-mutu wumuzimbwadi: «Yikuheka ngolu zoosu yi khembu ya luyalu lwa tsi yayi. Mu kyedika, meni báheka kiyeka kya bima bina byosu, yihánabya phi kwena mutu wuna thondi meni-meni. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Honi wapfukamina, byabi byosu bya ngeyi byakituka.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Básonika mu mukanda wa Nzambi: "Fukamina lwesi Pfumu Nzambi waku, yandi, yandi mosi lwesi wasadila."»<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Kiphidi-mutu wumunati hika ku Yelusalemi, wumunenginiki kuna kisoka kya mudilu wa nzu ya Nzambi amana wumuzimbwadi: «Honi ngeyi, wu Mwana wa Nzambi, ditsusula tuka haha yi hana tsi; <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Mukuma básonika mu mukanda wa Nzambi: "Nzambi kahána muswa kwena banzyo bandi ndangu bisa kulema." <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Amana phi "bakulela muna moku ma bawu ndangu kulu dyaku didikhukulaku ku tadi dimosi."» <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Básonika mu mukanda wa Nzambi: "Wamekaku Pfumu Nzambi waku."» <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Ha kásanda kuhukumuna Yesu, mitindu myosu, kunima, kiphidi-mutu wumusisi kikuma kya tangwa dya hika.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu kya Yesu ku Ngadidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mth 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesu, wabasa yi ngolu za Kitembu Kyatoma, wávutuka ku Ngadidi. Khululuka ya khumbu ya Yesu, yáyalangana muna mulambu wa Ngadidi wosu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Kwakuna, kakala longa mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta amana mutu wosu kakala muzatula.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mth 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yesu wénda ku Nazaleti, kuna kátsatsukila. Kilumbu kya sabata, wákota mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta bwosu kyákala kikalulu kyandi. Telami kikuma kya kutanga masonuku <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>amana bamuheki mukanda wa kuvunga kásonika mbikudi Yesaya. Hanga vungumuniwa, wumoni homa hana básonika:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>"Kitembu kya Pfumu kyenina ha thandu ya meni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">wátsita masi ndangu yinata Musamu wa Bukheti kwena baphutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wáthuma ndangu yisamuna kwena batu ba boloku ni lulubuki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kwena baphofu, ni bamóna hika wanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kiphwanza kwena batu bena mu kihika,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>kikuma yisamuna mvula ya mamboti ma Pfumu kwena batu."<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Kunima Yesu wávungawa mukanda, wuhekiwa kwena musadi amana wuzakadi. Batu boosu bakala mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, bahungudi mesu kwena yandi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Hanga wuyandiki kubasamwana: «Masonuku mama, tutangi mu kitini kyaki, kwena benu, lelu malungidi.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Boosu báyandika kuta kimbangi kya bawu kikuma kya Yesu amana báyandika kuyituka ku mambu ma bukheti kakala zonza. Bakala zonza: «Yandu, ka mwana Yozefu ku?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Mu kyedika, kilumbu, lwathíla kingana kyaki: "Munganga, dibuka ngemeni." Lwanzímbwala hika: "Twáyuka mambu moosu wáhanga ku Kaphedinawuma, hangeti mambu mana, buthwena, mu mbanza ya ngemeni yayi."» <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Kunima, wukosikidini: «Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi ni kweku mbikudi wisi lumina mu tsi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi ni mu tangwa dya mbikudi Diya, bafwidi lawu bákala mu Kiseledi; zilu dyánokisaku mvula, mu mvula tatu yi ngonda sambanu, nzala lawu yákota muna mulambu wosu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Kinga, Nzambi, kámutumaku Diya kwena mosi wa bawu, kaasi kwena mufwidi mosi lwesi wuna wakala zingila ku hata dya Salepita, mu kinzunga kya Sitoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Kwákala phi yi bakwa bwasi balawu mu tangwa dya mbikudi Disa, mu Kiseledi; kinga keti mosi wa bawu kásemaku lutu, kaasi Namani, lwesi, mwisi Sidya wásema lutu.» <verse eid="LUK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ha báyuka ndinga meni zina, boosu bákala muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, bahanga, bamingi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Bátelema, bamulubudi, Yesu, kufula dya mbanza amana bamunati ku londi dya mongu wuna bátunga Nazaleti, ndangu bamununguna ha tsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Kaasi wubalwetuki hana kati wenda kwandi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu wa kitembu kyambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Hanga, Yesu wénda ku Kaphedinawuma, mbanza ya Ngadidi; kakala longa malongi mandi mu kilumbu kya sabata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Batu bakala yituka mu phila kulonga kwandi, kikuma kakala zonza yi hamu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, mwákala yi mutu mosi bakala yangisa kwena kitembu kya mbi. Wakala kalunga: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Ah! Yesu mwisi Nazaleti! Khi mambu ngeyi yi betu? Wisi ndangu watuzanga? Nzayi mboti keti nani wenina ngeyi: Watoma bátuma kwena Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu wákayakya kitembu kina yi ngolu. Wuzonzi: «Dibata! Lubuka phi mwena mutu yandu!» Kitembu kya mbi kimubwisi ha tsi mutu wuna ku mesu ma batu boosu, amana kilubuki kwena yandi, konda kumuhanga kima kya mbi.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Amana batu boosu bákala hana báyituka lawu bekadihyula bawu yi bawu: «Khi mutindu wa ndinga yana? Mutu yandu kabati hana muswa yi ngolu yi hamu amana bitembu bya mbi bilubuki!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Amana khululuka ya Yesu yámwangana muna mulambu meni wawuna wosu.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubuka kwa bambefu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mth 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu wulubuki muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, wendi ku nzu ya Simoni. Buko bwa mukhetu wa Simoni kákala wabela yi kikhafuma amana balombi kwena Yesu ndangu kahanga dyambu kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Wuzenzamini kwena mukhetu wuna, amana muna ndinga ya ngolu, wukayikya kikhafuma kina. Muna mbala mosi, kimukatukini, wutelamini wuyandikini phi kubaheka madya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Ha kwáyila kuma, boosu bana bákala yi bambefu ba bawu bana bákala yi makhasi ma mutindu yi mutindu, babanati kwena Yesu, yandi weka bathetika moku amana wubabuki. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Amana bitembu bya mbi bilubuki kwena bambefu balawu, mu kukalunga: «Ngeyi wenina Mwana wa Nzambi!» Kaasi Yesu wáyandika kukayabya yi kukandikisabya ndangu bizonzaku hika, mukuma byawu phi byazaya ni Yesu, Masiya kákala.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Yesu mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Buna kwákhya kuma, Yesu wálubuka mu mbanza, wenda hunga mu tseki. Mulumba-lumba wa batu wáyandika kumusosa; ha bámumona, bázola kazakala yi bawu. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Kaasi Yesu kábazimbwala: «Bufwani kwena meni yenda samuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa kipfumu kya Nzambi ku mbanza za hika, kikuma kya bwabuna báthumina.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Amana Yesu kakala longa mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta za Yuteya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Balonguki batheti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mth 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wátelama kuna kabeta ka yanga dya mbuta dya Ngenezaleti amana kibuka kya batu bakala lundakana mu kuwongama kikuma kya kuyuka ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Yesu wámona midimba myodi kuna khungu ya mamba: balobi ba batsema bátuluka mu midimba, bekasukula mawanda ma bawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu wázanza muna mudimba wumosi, wuna wákala wa Simoni, wumulombi ni kanunguna koma ku mamba, kakatuka mu tsenga. Yesu wázakala muna mudimba, wáyandika kulonga malongi mandi kwena kibuka kya batu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Tangwa kámanisa kulonga, wázimbula kwena Simoni: «Phusana kuna dingu dya ndindi amana losenu mawanda menu ndangu lwaloba.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni wumuvutwadini: «Mulongi, tunyokuki phipha yosu mu kuloba, keti kima tukwatiku. Kaasi muna ndinga ya ngeyi, yitímbula mawanda.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Buna bátimbulama, bákwata mbumba yi mbwiti ya batsema: mawanda máyandika kutheta. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Hanga batekudi bakwawu khunda bana bákala mu mudimba wahika ndangu bisa basimbisa. Ha bísa bawu, bámona amana mu kimosi bawu boosu, bábasisa midimba myodi, hanga miyandiki kuzyonda. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni Phetelu, ha kámona bwabuna, wáfukama kuna mesu ma Yesu, wuzonzi phi: «Haluka, kwena meni, Pfumu, mukuma yenina musumuki!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Amana Simoni yi boosu bana bákala bawu, hanga kitswi kibakwati lawu, kikuma kya mbumba yi mbwiti ya batsema yina bákwata. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Phila mosi phi kwena bakwawu khunda ba kisalu bana bákala bawu Simoni, Zyaki yi Yowani bana ba Zebeteya. Bawu phi kitswi kyábakwata lawu. Kaasi Yesu wuzimbudi kwena Simoni: «Yukaku bweya; tuka lelu, ngeyi, batu walobiki.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bazakudini midimba mya bawu ku tseki, basisi bima bya bawu byosu, bendi landa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusema kwa mukwa bwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mth 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Amana Yesu kákala muna hata dimosi, mutu mosi, wákala lutu yi bwasi, wutudini. Yandi ha kámona Yesu, wudilosi kuna mesu mandi, mbunzu mu mafu, wuyandiki kumubokwadila: «Pfumu, yuka ni wuzodibwa, fwani watsemisa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu wálambula koku, wámusimba, wuzonzi phi: «Nzodibwa, sema!» Muna mbala mosi bwasi bumuwaluki. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu wumuheki mulongi wawu: «Wuzimbulaku kwena mutu, mambu mama. Kaasi ndawenda disongila kwena banganga Nzambi amana hana makabu ma kudisemisa bwosu kásilabwa Moyize, kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya bawu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Muna tangwa medina, khululuka ya Yesu yáyalangana muma mwosu; milumba-lumba mya batu myakala khokana mu kumuyuka yi kubeluka mu makhasi ma bawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Kaasi Yesu kakala hunga mu tseki yi kulombilaka.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa mukwa khonzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mth 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Amana kilumbu kimosi, Yesu kakala longa ha mesu ma Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku; bakala tuka mu mahata ma lawu ma Ngadidi yi ma Yuteya yi ma Yelusalemi. Ngolu za Pfumu zákala kumosi yi Yesu, zazina kakala bukilaka bambefu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Batu bisa nata kiphoyu kyákala mukwa khonzu; bakala sanda phila ya kumukotisila mu nzu ndangu bamutulula kuna mesu ma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Kaasi bakalaku lenda kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu. Hanga bazanzi yandi ha mudilu wa nzu, batubudi hundu hana kati dya matolu amana bamukulwamini hana kiphoyu kyandi hana kati dya lukutakanu kuna mesu ma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Buna kámona lukwikilu lwa bawu, Yesu wuzimbudi kwena mbefu: «Yakala, masumu maku makulolukini.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi báyandika kudihyula: «Nati kenina mutu yandu wubati lewula Nzambi? Nani fwani kalolula masumu, yukani ka yandi meni ku Nzambi lwesi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Kaasi Yesu wázaya mabanza ma bawu, hanga wubazimbwadi phi: «Kikuma kya biki lwenina yi mabanza ma buna mu mbundu zenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Biki byakonda phasi mu kuzonza?: "Masumu maku malolukini", ho "Telama, kangala"? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Ndangu lwazayabwa ni Mwana wa mutu kenina yi hamu ha tsi haha, dya kulolula masumu.» Hanga wuti ndinga kwena mukwa khonzu: «Yikuzimbwadi, telama, bonga kiphoyu kyaku, vutuka ku nzu yaku!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Muna mbala mosi, mutu wátelema ku mesu ma batu boosu, wázangula kiphoyu kyandi, hana kakala waleka amana wendi ku nzu yandi yi kuzatulaka Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Boosu báyituka lawu, bámuzatula Nzambi, báyuka bweya bwa lawu, bazonzi phi: «Lelu, tumoni mambu ma kuyituka!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wumutedi Lefi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mth 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Kunima dya mambu mana, Yesu wálubuka, wámona phi kalaki ka phaku mosi, khumbu yandi Lefi, wasikuka muna nzu ya kisalu ya yandi. Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Ndanda!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Amana Lefi wátelama, wásisa byosu, wenda mulanda phi. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Ku nima, Lefi wámuyidikila lawu dya madya muna nzu yandi; tulaki twa phaku lawu yi batu bahika bakala kuna mesa. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku bakala hana, kuna dingumba dya bawu, báyandika kubakumba; bendi zonza kwena balonguki ba Yesu: «Kikuma kya biki lubati dila yi kunwa ha kimosi yi tulaki twa phaku yi batu bahika basumuki?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu wubavutwadi: «Batu bana bena mu malutu yi ngolu, bisiku kala yi mupfunu wa munganga; kaasi bambefu bisi kala yi mupfunu wa munganga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Meni yisaku tela batu basungama, kaasi basumuki yisa tela ndangu basoba bikalulu.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi kuzila madya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mth 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Bafwadisi báhyula kwena Yesu: «Balonguki ba Yowani yi bana ba betu bayikana kuzila kudya yi kulombila; Kaasi balonguki ba ngeyi, bawu, bisi dya yi kunwa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Pfwani lwabazidisa kudya, banduku ba kikwedi mu tangwa dina kenina kikwedi hakimosi yi bawu? Bwalendaku salama! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Kaasi tangwa dyakwísa dina babakatula yandi kikwedi, hahana nana bazíla kudya.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Yesu wubatidi kingana kyaki: «Kweku mutu wayata muledi wa pha, kitemba kalondila muledi wa khulu, kondilo, kayata muledi wandi wa khatu, mukuma kitemba kya muledi wa pha kisiku kwelana yi sengi dya khulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Amana ka mutu ku wulongulula vinu dya pha mu bilungu bya khulu; kondilo, vinu dya pha dyabula bilungu, vinu dityakani amana bilungu bizangani. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Kaasi loni! Vinu dya pha, mboti mu bilungu bya pha! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Ka mutu ku wátonda kunwa hika vinu dya pha yukani wunwi kedi mulala. Mukuma, bisi zonza: "Mulala wenina wa bukheti."»<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mth 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Amana kilumbu kimosi kya sabata, Yesu kakala luta mu bilanga bya ngenza zimosi zenina hanga losu. Balonguki bandi bakala hela misambu, báyandika kunika ngenza zandi muna moku yi kudyaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Ndambu ya Bafwadisi bákala hakana hanga bazimbudi: «Kikuma kya biki lubati hangila mambu mafwaniku mu kuhanga, mu kilumbu kya sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Benu lwátangaku mambu káhanga Tavidi tangwa káyuka nzala yandi yi batu bana bákala yi yandi? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Kakota mu kikumbu kya Nzambi, wubongi mapha bahana mikhayilu kwena Nzambi, wudima amana wubaheki phi bakwawu bana kákala bawu, mbatanana bizila bizonzi ni, kaka banganga Nzambi batu lwesi bafwani kudya mapha mana bahani kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Mwana wa mutu yandi wenina pfumu wa kilumbu kya sabata.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi mutu wayumuka koku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mth 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Kilumbu kikwawu kya sabata, Yesu wákota mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, wáyandika kulonga. Mwakala mwamuna yi mutu mosi wákala koku dya kitata dyayumuka. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi bakala mulandila Yesu mu kiswiswiswi, batala ho mutu kakhana belula mu kilumbu kya sabata, mukuma phila bakala sanda ya kumufunda. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Kaasi Yesu wázaya mabanza ma bawu. Hanga wuzimbudi kwena mutu yandu wákala koku dyayumuka: «Telama, awisa haha, ha mbasi.» Mutu, kahanga wutelami, wendi kwakuna. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Kunima Yesu wázimbula: «Yiluhyudibwa ni abweti milombi mitsiku myetu, mu kilumbu kya sabata? Kuhanga bukheti ho mbi? Kuhulula moya wa mutu ho kutotisawa?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Kahanga, batadi boosu, kunima wázimbula kwena mutu wuna: «Yuna koku dyaku.» Mutu wuna wáyuna, koku dimutomini. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Kaasi balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi báfunga khabu, bekatendana bawu yi bawu keti bweti bafwana muhanga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusola kwa bathumwa kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mth 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Yesu wátombuka ku mongu wumosi kikuma kya kulombila Nzambi, kásala phipha ya muthu, mu kulombila. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Kuma ha kwákhya, wubatedi balonguki bandi amana wusodini kumi yi bodi, wubahekini khumbu ni bathumwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni wuna káheka, yandi, khumbu ya Phetelu yi myaki wandi wa yakala Andele, Zyaki yi Yowani, Fidiphu yi Batolomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mathayi yi Tomasi, Zyaki mwana Alufwe yi Simoni wuna wákala mu kibuka kya batu bana bakala wila diphanda, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yuta mwana wa Zyaki yi Yutasi Sikadyoti, wuna wálambula Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi yi kubeluka kwa batu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mth 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu kákulumuka ku mongu yi bathumwa bandi, hanga wutelami ha musenzi, hana hákala kibuka kya balonguki bandi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu bátuka ku mulambu wa Yuteya dyosu yi ku Yelusalemi yi ku mahata ma Tidi yi Sitoni; <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Bísa ndangu bamuyuka amana kababuka, bana bákala yi bisambu bya maladi. Batu bana bakala yangisa kwena bitembu bya mbi, bawu phi bákola. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Batu boosu bakala sanda tswetswa ya kumusimba kikuma ngolu zimosi zakala lubuka mu lutu lwandi, zakala babuka boosu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Byesi yi kyadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mth 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu wubatadini balonguki bandi amana wuzonzi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Kyesi, kwena benu baphutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">mukuma kipfumu kya Nzambi kyenina kwena benu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Kyesi kwena benu lubati fwa nzala buthwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mukuma lwavwa madya ma lawu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Kyesi kwena benu lubati dila buthwena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mukuma lwaséya!»<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>«Kyesi kwena benu bisi menga, bisi kukwasa, bisi sawula amana bisi kumba khumbu zenu kwena batu kikuma kya Mwana wa mutu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Sangwalenu mu kilumbu kina malúngila mambu mana amana kinenu makinu ma muzandu mukuma lufutu lwa mbuta lubati luhingila kuna zilu. Mukuma, bwabuna, bakhaka ba bawu, bakala nyokuna bambikudi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Kaasi kyadi kwena benu bamvwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">kikuma lutambudi kedi mamboti menu, lwahíngilaku hika kima!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Kyadi kwena benu ludiyukwatidi kedi, buthwena, kikuma nzala lwayúka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kyadi kwena benu lubati seya, buthwena, mukuma mu khondu yi matsanga lwakála!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>«Kyadi kwena benu bisi zatula kwena batu mukuma bwabuna bakhaka ba bawu bakala zatula bambikudi ba bukamvi!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutya bambeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mth 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Kaasi nzimbudi kwena benu lubati ngyuka ni tondenu bambeni benu, hangenu bukheti kwena batu bana bisi lumenga, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>sambulenu batu bana bisi lusinga amana lombilenu kikuma kya batu bana bisi lunyokuna. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Honi mutu kakuta mbata ku tama dimosi, musila hika dikwawu; honi mutu katambula muzaka waku, muyambula katambula hika kikutu kyaku. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Wosu wuna wakulomba kima, muheka. Futisaku kima kwena mutu wuna wukubwotudikya. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Hangenu kwena bakwenu bwosu lwisi tya benu phi baluhangila. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Honi lwatondaka lwesi batu bana bisi lutonda, biki hika lwatánikina kwena Nzambi? Phila mosi yi basumuki bana bisi tonda batu bana bisi batya bawu phi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Amana yuka ni lwahangaka bukheti lwesi kwena batu bana bisi luhanga mboti, biki hika lwatánikina kwena Nzambi? Phila mosi yi basumuki bana bisibwa hanga! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Amana ho ni lwalefisaka lwesi kwena batu bana lwisi sya mbundu ni baluvutwala, biki hika lwatanikina kwena Nzambi? Phila mosi yi basumuki bisi dilefisa bawu yi bawu amana badivutwadi! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Kaasi benu, tondenu bambeni benu, bahangilenu bukheti, balefisenu phi konda kusya mbundu ni kima balúvutwala. Amana lufutu lwenu lwákala lwa mbuta, benu lwakála phi bana ba Nzambi wa Phungu, mukuma yandi wamboti kikuma kya bakonda-kabanzi yi bakholwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Kalenu babasa yi khenda bwosu kábasa tata wenu yi khenda.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufundisaku mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mth 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Lufundisaku amana benu phi balúfundisaku; luzengilaku bakwenu ndola amana benu phi balúzengilaku ndola; lolulenu bakwenu, bawu phi balúlolula. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Kabilenu bakwenu amana Nzambi kalúkabila benu phi: kabásisa mawaba menu yi kuvwa kwa lawu. Kasómama, wuningisima ndangu masomama yi hana thandu. Nzambi katésa makabu menu bwosu lwisi tesila benu phi bakwenu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yesu wubazonzidi hika mu kingana: «Phofu kafwaniku kusongila mukwawu phofu nzila, Kondilo, babwa mu dibulu babodi. Kabwaku? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Kweku mulonguki wuluti mulongi wandi; kaasi mulonguki wuna baswaniki bwa bukheti, kafwánana hanga mulongi wandi. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Kikuma kya biki wisi tadila kitswala kyenina mu disu dya phangi waku amana wubatiku mona mudikita miti wenina mu disu dyaku? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Abweti walenda zimbula kwena phangi waku: "Mukwetu, yambula yikukatula kitswala kyaki kyenina mu disu", ngeyi wusiku mona mudikita miti wenina mu disu dya ngeyi meni? Kavungalosi, katula theti miti wena mu disu dyaku amana wamona wanga mu kukatula kitswala kyenina mu disu dya phangi waku.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miti yi bibundu byandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mth 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Miti wamboti wisiku ha bibundu bya mbi, mutindu mosi yi miti wambi, wisiku ha bibundu bya mboti. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Miti wosu bisiwa zayila ku bibundu byandi: kibundu kya fiki bisiku helakya mu minzumbila amana phi bisiku hela kibundu kya vinu mu miti mya tsaku. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mutu wamboti kisi hola mambu mamboti mu kimvwama kya bukheti kina kyenina mu mbundu yandi; mutu wambi phi kisi hola mambu mambi mu kimvwama kya mbi kina kyenina mu mbundu yandi; mukuma mutu wosu kisi lubula mu munwa, mambu moosu mana mabasa muna fuka dya mbundu yandi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzu zodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mth 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>Kikuma kya biki lwisi thedila: «Pfumu, Pfumu, kaasi lwisiku hanga mambu mana yisiluzimbwala? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Yilúsongila yi nati kafwanani mutu yandu wisi kwena meni, wuyuki ndinga za meni amana wusiza mu bisalu: <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>yandi kenina hanga mutu mosi wátunga nzu; kahanga simi lawu mumbulu-mbulu amana wutungi mupfundila hana thandu ya tadi. Ha kisa dinata kizalu, mamba ma nzadi maditi kuna nzu kaasi konda kunikana kikuma kitoku bátungaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Kaasi wosu wuna wuyuki ndinga za meni, kalundizoku phi, fwanani yi mutu wuna mukwawu wátunga nzu yandi ha thandu ya fusyangeni, yakonda mupfundila. Ha mísa mamba ma nzadi, maditi kuna nzu, yosu yiwulumukini: yimwangani.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini musadi wa pfumu wa baphumbulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mth 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Ha kámanisa, Yesu, kuzonza mambu mana kwena batu bákala hana, wénda ku mbanza ya Kaphedinawumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Kwakuna, kwákala yi satudiyoni<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satudiyoni disongidila ni pfumu wuna wakala twadisa baphumbulu khama ba Loma</char></note> mosi kákala yi musadi wandi wuna kakala tonda lawu. Musadi meni wuna kákala wabela mu kulakana. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Mu tangwa káyuka, kaphiteni, khululuka ya Yesu, hanga wutumi ndambu ya bambuta ba Bayuta ndangu benda mubokwadila Yesu, kisa mubuka musadi wandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ha bátula kwena Yesu, báyandika kumubokwadila yi nziki-nziki: «Mutu wuna bulungi wenda musadisa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Mukuma kisi tonda kikanda kyetu, yandi phi wátutungila nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Hanga Yesu wendi bawu nzila mosi. Kakalaku kyana yi nzu, tangwa kámutumina, satudiyoni, banduku bandi ndangu bamuzimbwala: «Pfumu, diyangisaku. Yeku walungila mu kukutambwasa ni wakota mu nzu ya meni; <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>hahana khondi kwisilaka meni-meni, mu kimwesa mutu, kwena ngeyi. Kaasi zonza ndinga mosi amana musadi wama kábeluka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Mukuma, meni-meni yenina mu sina dya hamu dya bapfumu bama amana yena yi baphumbulu bama bisi ndemvukila. Ho ni yizimbula kwena mosi: "Ndawenda!", wendi; ho ni yizimbula kwena mukwawu wa hika: "Nzawisa!" amana wisi; amana kwena musadi wama: "Hanga bwabu!" amana wuhangibwa.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Ha kayuka mambu mana, ma Kaphiteni, Yesu wáyituka. Kahanga wubaluki kwena kibuka kina kyakala mulanda amana wuzonzi: «Yiluzimbwadibwa ni keti mu Kiseledi, khaku kedi mbona kikumbwala kya mbuta, kya mutindu wawu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Ha bisa vutuka bambambala, bana bátuma, ku nzu ya Kaphiteni, bisa wana musadi wuna wukodi kedi.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufutumuni mwana wa mufwidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Hanga Yesu wendi ku hata dimosi bisi tela Nayini; balonguki bandi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu bakala kwenda nzila mosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Tangwa kátula ku fula dya hata dina, bekanata mvumbi mosi ku mazyamu: kákala mwana yakala wa mufwidi mosi, yandi hika. Batu balawu ba hata medina bákala yi ngudi wuna. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Pfumu, ha kámumona mufwidi, kiwayi kimukwati kikuma kya yandi amana wumuzimbwadi: «Wudilaku!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Kahanga wubwesuki, wusimbi phi mukunzu; batu bana bakalawa nata batelami. Yesu wuzonzi: «Mwana yakala, yikuzimbwadi: tokama!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Amana mvumbi wásikuka, wáyandika phi kuzonza. Yesu wámuhana kwena ngudi wandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Batu boosu bweya bwábakwata, báyandika kumuzatula Nzambi mu kuzonza: «Mbikudi wambuta wulubukini ha kati kya betu!» Amana phi «Nzambi wisi yakidila batu bandi!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Amana muna tsi ya Yuteya yi binzunga byandi byosu báyuka khululuka ya mambu mana káhanga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bambambala ba Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mth 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Balonguki ba Yowani bázimbula, kwena mulongi wa bawu, mambu mana moosu buna málutila. Yowani wátela bodi muna kati kya balonguki ba bawu; <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>amana wábatuma kwena Pfumu benda muhyula: «Ngeyi, yi Masiya wuna wakwísa, ho twahingila mutu wa hika?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Ha bátula kwena Yesu, bamuzimbwadini: «Yowani Mubotiki wututumi twakuhyula: "Ngeyi, Masiya wuna wufwani mu kukwisa, ho twahingila mutu wa hika?» <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Muna tangwa medina, Yesu wábuka batu balawu bákala yi bisambu bya maladi, minyanga, wákukwasa bitembu bya mbi bákala byawu yi kutemuna mesu kwena baphofu ba lawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Kahanga bavutwadi mvutu, batu babana kátuma Yowani: «Ndalwenda, lwamusamwana, Yowani, mambu mana lumoni yi mana luyuki ni baphofu babati mona hika, bakwa khonzu babati kangala, bakwa bwasi basemi, tuhuwa tuyuki, bamvumbi bafutumuki, Musamu wa Bukheti balongiwa kwena baphutu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Kyesi kwena mutu wuna wakonda yambula kikumbwala kyandi mwena meni!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Tangwa bávutuka bathumwa ba Yowani, Yesu wáyandika kuzonzila kikuma kya Yowani kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu: «Biki lwendi talaka mu nganga? Koma ka muswangina kana kabati ningana ku muphephi, kabwaku? Loni? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Amana biki lwendi talaka? Mutu mosi wuvwatiki miledi mya kitoku? Kaasi batu baba bisi vwata miledi mya kitoku, bisi zinga luzingu lwa lukumu, mu nzu za bathotila bisi kala. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Biki lwendi talaka? Mbikudi mosi? Bwana, bwosu yiluzimbwadi, yandi wuluti mbikudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Kikuma kya yandi básonika mu mukanda wa Nzambi»:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">«Yitúma mbambala wama ha thwala ngeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mu kukuyidikila nzila.»<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Yesu yiki hika: «Yiluzimbwadibwa ni heku mutu, ha kati dya baba bábutuka kwena mukhetu, wuluti Yowani; kinga wuna wena wa khunda mu kipfumu kya Nzambi wumuluti. <verse eid="LUK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Batu boosu bana bámuyuka yi tulaki twa phaku, boosu bákwikila ni Nzambi kenina wasingama amana babaludi mbundu, batambwasi phi kutambula mbotika kwena Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Kinga Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku bana bákala hana, hanga babwisi mambu kazola kubahangila Nzambi; bábwisa kutambula mbotika ya Yowani.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu wuzonzi hika: «Yi banani pfwani yifwanikisa batu ba buthwena bwabu? Bafwanani yi banani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Bafwanakani yi bana baba bazakadi hana zandu, babati dizonzila: "Tulusikidi mahongi ma kyesi kaasi lukiniku! Tulusidi biwolu, ludidiku! <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Kikuma, Yowani Mubotiki wisi, kisiku dya dipa keti kunwa vinu, amana benu yikuzonzaka: "Kitembu kya mbi kena kyawu!" <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Ha yisi meni Mwana wa mutu, yibati dya yi kunwaka, amana benu yikuzimbulaka: "Talenu mutu yandu wisi banza lwesi kudya yi kunwaka vinu, yameni nduku wa tulaki twa phaku yi basumuki. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Kaasi boosu bana bisi landa mudimu wa Nzambi bisi songila ni zasungama zenina.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu muna nzu ya Simoni Mufwadisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mufwadisi mosi wálomba kwena Yesu ndangu kenda dya ku nzu yandi. Yesu wákota muna nzu, wubongi homa phi kuna mesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Kinga mwákala yi mukhetu mosi muna mbanza meni yayina, musumuki. Ha káyuka ni Yesu ku mesa kena muna nzu ya Mufwadisi, wisi nata nganza yimosi ya kabasi yi mananasi ma tsunga ma thalu ya lawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Wisi telama kuna kunda dya Yesu, kuna bitambi byandi. Wekadila, kitsanga kyandi kiyandiki kunoka muna bitambi bya Yesu; kunima, wuphangusibya yi khambu zandi, wunukibya amana phi wusitibya mananasi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Buna kamona bwabuna, Mufwadisi wuna wámutedisa, wáyandika kudizonzila kuna mbundu: «Wadi mutu yandu kákala mbikudi, kakhani bakula keti nati kenina mukhetu yandu wubati musimba yi buna kenina: musumuki.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Amana Yesu wátambula ndinga, wuzimbudi kwena Mufwadisi: «Simoni, dyambu yena dyawu thondi yikuzimbwala.» Simoni wumuvutwadi: «Zonza Mulongi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Hanga Yesu wuzonzi: «Batu bodi bafwana kufuta pfuka za makuta ma lawu kwena mukwa zawu. Mosi kafwana kavutula khama tanu za mafwalanga amana mukwawu makumatanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Babodi, bwosu bakalaku yi kima kya kufuta pfuka zina, hanga mukwa pfuka wábayambwadilaza. Nati, hana kati kya babodi wahita kumutonda?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni wumuvutwadi: «Meni mboni ni wuna káyambwadila yi pfuka ya lawu.» Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Mboti wuzengi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Yesu kábaluka kwena mukhetu wuna, wuzimbudi phi kwena Simoni: «Wumoni mukhetu yandu? Meni khoti mu nzu yaku, kaasi wuphekiku keti mamba kikuma kya bitambi byama; kaasi yandi wutsukudi bitambi yi matsanga mandi kusumunima phi yi khambu zandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Wungyambiku, tangwa khotiki mu nzu yaku; kaasi yandi kabatiku lembwa kunuka bitambi byama, tuka buna khotidiki. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Wutsitikiku masi ku mutwa wama, kaasi yandi wutsiti mananasi ma tsunga ku bitambi byama. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Ihana yikuzimbwadi ni masumu mandi ma lawu, mamuloluki kikuma tonda dyandi dya lawu kasongidi. Kaasi mutu wuna baloludi masumu ma khunda, kisi songila phi tonda dya khunda.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Amana Yesu wázimbula kwena mukhetu: «Masumu maku malolukini.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Bana kákala bawu ku mesa báyandika kudizonzila: «Nati kenina mutu yandu, walenda lolula yi masumu ma batu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Kaasi Yesu wázimbula kwena mukhetu: «Lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini: ndawenda mu ngemba.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Bakhetu bana bakala mulanda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Kunima, Yesu wénda mu mbanza yi mu mahata kikuma kya kulonga, mwamuna, yi kusamunaka Musamu wa Bukheti wa Kipfumu kya Nzambi ha kimosi yi bawu Kumi yi bodi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>yi ndambu ya bakhetu bahika bana bábeluka mu bitembu bya mbi yi mu bisambu bya maladi: hanga Madiya wuna bisi tela: Makatala, mwena yandu mwálubuka bitembu bya mbi tsambwadi; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Zyani mukhetu wa Kuza, yandu wákala pfumu wa bakalaki mu nzu ya kisalu ya thotila Eloti; Suzani yi bakhetu bahika balawu, boosu, bakala hana bima bya bawu ndangu byamusadisaka Yesu yi bathumwa bandi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukuni wa bilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mth 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Batu balawu bakala tuka mu mbanza za mutindu yi mutindu, bisi kutakana kuna kakala Yesu, wubatidi kingana kyaki: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Mukuni mosi wenda kuna kheni, kuna kilanga kyandi. Ha kakala mwanga kheni, ndambu yahika yenda bwila mu nzila: hanga batu bamaniya dyatikisa, banuni bátuka ku zilu, bisiya dya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ndambu ya hika yenda bwila mu mafu ma matadi: ha yamena, miti myáyumuka kikuma myákalaku mu mafu ma tsimina. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Ndambu yahika yenda bwila ha kati kya tsaku. Tsaku ziyandiki kukola ha kimosi yi ngwalengi ya bukheti; hanga zikakidikisiya. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Kaasi kheni yikwawu, yábwila mu mafu ma bukheti, yákola, yihe phi kheni khama ku khama.» Kunima dya kuzonza bwabuna, Yesu yiki hika: «Wuna wenina yi matu ma kuyuka, kayuka!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikuma kya biki kakala zonzila Yesu mu bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mth 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Balonguki bandi bámuhyula, biki kisongidila kya kingana kyaki. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Yandi wubavutwadi: «Nzambi wáluheka, benu, mbakisilu ya kubakula bitsweki bya Kipfumu kya Nzambi; kaasi kwena bahika, wábazimbwalama mu bingana, ihana»:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">"Bafwani kumona kaasi bisiku mona kima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">bafwani kuyuka kaasi bisiku bakula."<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubangumuni kingana kya mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mth 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Yukenu kisongidila kya kingana kyaki: mbutu, yenina ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Yina yábwila mu kabeta ka nzila: yenina batu bana bisi yuka ndinga ya Nzambi, kunima kiphidi-mutu wisi katulaya muna mbundu za bawu ndangu bakwikilaku hanga bahuluka nana. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Bahika benina hanga mafu ma matadi: bisi yuka ndinga ya Nzambi amana bisiya tambula yi kyesi kyosu. Kaasi yisiku zika misodi, kikumbwala kya bawu kyenina mu tangwa dya khunda, mu tangwa dya phasi, balosikya. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Kheni yina yábwila ha kati kya tsaku, benina babana bisi yuka Ndinga, kaasi kunima mayanu yi kimvwama yi byesi bya luzingu, bisiya kakidikisa ndangu yihaku bibundu byakola. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Kheni yina yábwila mu mafu ma bukheti, benina batu babana bisi yuka Ndinga ya Nzambi, balundiya muna mbundu yafwana yi ya bukheti; amana yibuti kheni yi kusipha kwa mbundu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mwinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Ka mutu ku wisi lemisa mwinda amana kendawa fidinga katini kondilo kendawa sweka ku tsi ya thangi. Kaasi bisiwa tudika hana thandu ya muzanga wa mwinda ndangu batu boosu bakóta mu nzu bamona mutemu. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Mukuma kweku kima kyaswamana, kyakonda zayakana, kweku kitsweki kyakonda tunguluka amana byosu byámonika ha kitelengeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Kebenu mu mana lwisi yuka, mukuma bakósikila kwena mutu wuna wenina kedi yi kima kyandi kaasi kwena mutu wuna weku yi kima, bamúbwotula keti koma kana kasi sila mbundu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi wa Yesu yi baphangi bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mth 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Ngudi wa Yesu yi baphangi bandi bisa bamumona; kaasi bálendaku kutula kuna kákala yandi kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Bendi muzibwala Yesu bwabu: «Ngudi waku yi baphangi baku, ha nzila benina, bazodi ni bakumona.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Kaasi Yesu wázimbula kwena bawu boosu: «Ngudi wama yi baphangi bama, benina batu bana bisi yuka ndinga ya Nzambi, bisiya sadila phi.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulembama kwa pfunzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mth 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wákota mu mudimba yi balonguki bandi, kahanga wubazimbwadi: «Tulabukenu ku sambwa dina dya yanga.» Amana bénda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Ha bakala labuka, Yesu wánimba. Muna kithulumukina, kimbongila kyátukula hana mukanda wa mamba; masuwa máyandika kukota mamba, mu kihonza bákala. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Balonguki bábwesuka kwena Yesu, bámutokamisa mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Mulongi, mulongi tukuluki betu!» Yesu wátokama, wákayaya pfunzi yi mamba, byádibata. Talala dyávutuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Yesu wábazimbwala balonguki bandi: «Akweti kyenina kikumbwala kyenu?» Kaasi bweya bwábakwata, báyituka lawu, amana bekazonza: «Nati kenina mutu yandu? Kabati hana muswa kwena pfunzi yi mamba amana byosu, bimuyukidi!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa mutu mosi wa bitembu bya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mth 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu yi balonguki bandi bátula mu tsi ya bisi Ngelasoni, yina yenina ku sambwa dyatalana yi Ngadidi. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Tangwa kátuluka Yesu ha tsi, mutu mosi wa ku mbanza meni yana, kákala yi bitembu bya mbi wísa kuna thwala ya yandi. Tuka thama kakalaku vwata hika miledi, amana kakalaku nimba hika mu nzu yandi, kaasi muna mazyamu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Tangwa kámona Yesu, wákalunga, wádilosa muna malu mandi, wuzonzi phi yi ngolu zoosu: «Biki wisi kotila mambu ma meni, Yesu Mwana Nzambi wa ku zilu? Yikubokwadidi, ngyangisaku!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Mukuma Yesu kakala kukwasa kitembu kya mbi kwena mutu ndangu kyalubuka mwena yandi, kyamusisa. Kitembu kina tangwa dya lawu kyákala mu kati dya yandi, kyámukotila tuka thama; kakala zingila wakukasa mu miyololu yi bisengu kuna malu yi ku moku yi kumutanikina, kaasi kakala tabulamya, amana phi kitembu kyákala mutuma katinaka mu tseki. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Hanga Yesu wumuhyudi: «Biki khumbu yaku?» Yandi wuvutudi: «Khumbu yama "Khwingi".» Mukuma bitembu bya mbi lawu byákota mwena yandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Hanga bitembu bimubokwadidi Yesu ndangu kabatumaku mu kalunga.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Hakana, hákala yi kibuka kya bangulu bakala sosa madya muna mongu. Bitembu bina byámubokwadila Yesu ni kabatuma benda kota muna bangulu meni babana. Hanga Yesu wubaheki muswa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Bitembu bya mbi byálubuka mwena mutu, byákota mu bangulu. Hanga kibuka kya bangulu kyosu kikatuki ku mongu, kyendi kota mu yanga dya thibu, báfwa phi. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Batu bana bakala hungula bangulu, buna bámona mambu mana, bátina, bendi nata tsangu mu mbanza yi mu mahata. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Hanga batu balubuki mu kutala mana máhita. Bísa kuna kákala Yesu, báwana phi mutu wuna bálubula bitembu bya mbi: wuzakadiki muna malu ma Yesu, wuvwatiki miledi, mabanza ma kimutu mamuvutwakisi. Hanga batu, bweya bubakwati. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Babana bámona mambu moosu mana máhita, bámenika buna kábelukila mutu wuna wákala yi bitembu bya mbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Bakwa kinzunga kina kya Ngelasoni bálomba kwena Yesu ni kakatuka ku mulambu wa bawu, kikuma bweya bwa lawu bákala bwawu. Yesu wákota mu mudimba, wávutuka phi. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mutu wuna bálubula bitembu bya mbi wámubokwadila Yesu ndangu kakalaka yi yandi. Kaasi Yesu wámukula, wuzimbudi phi: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Vutuka ku nzu yaku, ndawenda samuna mambu moosu mana kasadi Nzambi kikuma kya ngeyi.» Mutu wuna wénda, wásamuna phi mambu mana moosu kámusadila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana wa Zayilusi wa mukhetu yi mukhetu wuna wasimba mvwela ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mth 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Tangwa kávutwakisa, Yesu, ku sambwa dya yanga dya thibu, bámuyamba kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu, mukuma boosu bakala muhingila. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Mutu mosi, khumbu yandi Zayilusi, wátula. Yandi kákala pfumu wa nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. Hanga wudilosi muna malu ma Yesu, wumubokwadidi ndangu kenda ku nzu yandi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>kikuma kákala yi mwana wandi yandi mosi wa mukhetu, wekalungisa mvula kumi yi zodi, kakala lakana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Mu tangwa kakala kwenda, Yesu, mulumba-lumba wa batu wakala mukakidikisa, tselu yi tselu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Kinga hákala hana meni, yi mukhetu mosi wakala noka menga tukila mvula kumi yi zodi. Wámanisa kuvwa kwa luzingu lwandi kwosu kwena bandomvi, kaasi keti mutu kálendaku kumubelula. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Kahanga wisi bwesuka kuna kunda dya Yesu, amana wusimbi nzenzi ya muledi wa Yesu. Muna mbala mosi, menga mámukangama. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Hanga Yesu wuhyudi: «Nati wutsimbi?» Boosu báyandika kutuna ni basadibwoku, Phetelu wuzonzi phi: «Mulongi, mulumba-lumba wa batu wawu wukuzyetiki, yi babana babati kufitikisa tselu zoosu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Kaasi Yesu wuvutudini: «Mutu wutsimbi, mukuma ngyuki ni ngolu zimosi zilubuki kwena meni.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mukhetu kádimona ni wutunguluki, hanga wisi yi tsula zoosu, wádilosa kuna bitambi bya Yesu. Wáyandika kuzimbula, hana mesu ma batu boosu, kikuma kina kámusimbila Yesu yi buna kábeluka mu mbala yimosi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Mwana wama wa mukhetu, lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini. Awenda mu ngemba.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Muna tangwa dina kakala zonza Yesu, bwabuna, mutu mosi wátuka ku nzu ya Zayilusi wisa muzimbwala: «Mwana waku wa mukhetu wufini. Wumuyangisaku hika Mulongi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Kaasi Yesu wámuyuka, amana wuzimbudi kwena Zayilusi: «Yukaku bweya! Kwikila lwesi, amana mwana waku wa mukhetu kahúluka.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Tangwa kátula Yesu ku nzu, wábwisa batu bakotaku mu nzu. Hanga kotisi lwesi Phetelu yi Yowani yi Zyaki yi tata yi ngudi wa mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Batu boosu bakala dila yi kuyanana kikuma kya mwana wa mukhetu. Hanga Yesu wuzimbudi: «Loni, ludilaku. Mwana kafiku, wanimba kenina.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Kaasi batu bayandiki kumuseya mukuma bázaya ni mwana wufiki kedi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Kaasi Yesu wumusimbi mu koku, wuzonzi phi mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Tokama kwaku mwana!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Moya wandi wuvutuki, wutokami, muna mbala mosi. Yesu wubazimbwadi ni bamuheka bima bya kudya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Tata yi ngudi wa mwana wa mukhetu báyituka lawu, kaasi Yesu wábakandisa ni bazimbulaku kwena mutu mambu mana máluta.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutumi balonguki kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mth 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu wátela bawu Kumi yi bodi, amana wábaheka ngolu yi hamu hana thandu ya bitembu bya mbi byosu yi mu kubuka bisambu bya kubela. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Amana wábatuma kusamuna Kipfumu kya Nzambi yi kubuka bambefu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Wubazimbwadi: «Lunataku kima mu nzila: keti koka, keti waba, keti kudya, keti makuta, amana mutu kakalaku yi miledi myodi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Amana yosu nzu yina lwakóta, kalenu mwamuna yi kuna lwalubwakilamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Amana muma mwosu muna baluyambiku batu, mu kulubuka mu mbanza, khukumunenu fusyangeni dya bitambi byenu: ndangu kyakala kambangu kikuma kya bawu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Amana bwana bálubuka; báyandika kuluta hata muna hata; mu kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti yi kubuka kwa bambefu muma mwosu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabanza ma Eloti mayangalakani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mth 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Eloti wuna wákala mosi wa bakyamvu baya, wuna wakala yala ku Ngadidi wuyuki mosu mana makala luta, amana mabanza mamuyekina yangalakanu, kikuma bahika bakala zonza: «Yowani wufutumuki ku bafwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Bahika bakala zimbula: «Diya wuna wulubukini». Bakwawu phi: «Mosi wa bambikudi bakhulu wufutumuki.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Kaasi Eloti kakala zimbula: «Yowani, meni-meni yímubukwasa mutwa. Amana nati kenina, yandu mbati yuka kuzonzila mambu mana?» Amana kakala sanda kumumona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisi batu mafunda matanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mth 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ywn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Amana bathumwa, mu kuvutuka kwa bawu, bámuzimbwala Yesu moosu mana báhanga. Wubabongi amana wendi ku phungamu, ku sambwa dya mbanza yimosi bisi tela ni Betisayita. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu ha bábakulabwa, hanga bamulandi. Yandi wubayambi, wuyandiki kubazonzila Kipfumu kya Nzambi, amana wubuki batu, bana bákala yi mupfunu wa kubeluka. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Kaasi kuma kwáyandika kuyila; bawu Kumi yi bodi bisa bwesuka, bámuzimbwala: «Kula mulumba-lumba wa batu, ndangu benda sanda bizika mu mahata yi mafedime ma bela-bela ndangu bamona muma mwa kuleka yi bima bya kudya, mukuma homa thwena ku phungamu, ha kati kya tseki». <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Kaasi wubazimbwadi: «Bahekenu kudya benu-benu!» Bavutudi: «Thweku yi mapha maluti matanu yi batsema bodi. Akolu ni thwenda sumba madya, betu-betu kikuma kya batu baba boosu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Mu bwana, hákala kitesu kya mafunda matanu ma bayakala. Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Bazakadisenu mu bibuka bya batu makumatanu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Bahangi bwabuna, amana bábazakadisa boosu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesu wábonga mapha matanu yi batsema bodi, wásekula mesu ku zilu amana wásakumunabya. Kunima, wábukununabya amana wáhanabya kwena balonguki ndangu bakabisabya kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Boosu bádya amana báyukuta. Bánata bitunga kumi yi byodi bya bitini bina byásala.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wusamuni ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mth 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Amana kilumbu kimosi, Yesu kakala lombila ku phungamu amana balonguki bákala kumosi yi yandi. Hanga wubahyudi: «Biki misi zonza milumba-lumba mya batu kikuma kya meni?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Bawu bavutudi: «Bahika bisi zonza ni ngeyi wena Yowani Mubotiki, bakwawu hika ni ngeyi, wena Diya, bakwawu bana bahika ni ngeyi, wenina mosi hana kati kya bambikudi bana ba khulu, wuna wufutumukini.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesu wubahyudi: «Amana kikuma kya benu, nati yenina?» Phetelu wuvutudi: «Ngeyi wena Kidisitu wa Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni lufwa yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mth 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mlk 8:38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesu kábasidingisa ni bazimbulabwoku kwena mutu; <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>wuyiki: «Bulungi, Mwana wa mutu kanyokuka lawu; bamulosila kwena bambuta ba Bayuta, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku; bamúhonda amana kilumbu kya tatu, kafútumuka.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Amana kakala zimbula kwena boosu: «Yuka ni mutu wuzodini kandanda, kadizimbakana yandi meni, katikula kitakani kyandi kosu kilumbu amana kandanda. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Mukuma wuna watónda kuhulula moya wandi, mu kyedika katótisawa; kaasi wuna watótisa moya wandi kikuma kya meni, yandi kahúlulawa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Amana khi mupfunu kwena mutu kavwa tsi yosu, ho kaditotisa kwandi yandi wosu, kondilo kadizanga? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Mukuma wuna wangyúka tsoni yi ndinga zama, Mwana wa mutu tsoni kamúyuka, tangwa kakwisa vutuka muna khembu yandi yi mu khembu ya Tata yi yina ya banzyo ba Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Amana, mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi, ndambu ya batu, mu kati dya babana benina haha, badifwilaku, konda kumona Kipfumu kya Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khembu ya Mwana wa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mth 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Amana bilumbu keti nana byáluta, kunima ndinga zina, Yesu wábonga Phetelu, Yowani yi Zyaki, amana wátombuka yi bawu ku mongu kikuma kya kulombila. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Amana tangwa kakala lombila, mbunzu yandi yásoba, amana miledi myandi myekina mya phembi yimosi yakala kedyamina. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Amana, kutala, batu bodi bákala hahana, yi kuyambilaka yandi: bakala Moyize yi Diya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>bakala monika mu kati dya khembu yi kuzonzilaka kwenda kwa yandi, kuna kwafwana kusalama ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Phetelu yi bakwawu khunda ku kilu kya ngolu bákala; kaasi ha bátokama, bámona khembu ya yandi yi batu bodi bana bákala yi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Tangwa bakala hambwasana batu bana yi Yesu, Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Mulongi, bwena mboti ni twakalenu kwetu haka. Tutungenu masombolu matatu, dimosi dya ngeyi, dimosi dya Moyize yi dimosi dya Diya.» Kakalaku zaya mana kakala zonza. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Buna kakala zonza bwana, tuti dimosi dyisi bafidinga ku kininga kyandi. Hanga balonguki bweya bubakwati, tangwa dyábafidinga tuti. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Amana ndinga yimosi yálubuka muna tuti: «Yandu-yandu kenina Mwana wa meni, wuna yisola. Muyukilenu!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Tangwa yáyukalakana ndinga, Yesu yandi hika kakala. Balonguki badibati, amana konda kuzimbula kwena mutu mosi, mu bilumbu meni byabina, mu mana bamona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki mwana mosi wakala yi kitembu kya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mth 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mlk 9:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, tangwa bakulumuka ku mongu, mulumba-lumba wa batu wisa mutundakana. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Hana kati dya mulumba-lumba wa batu, mutu mosi wákalunga: «Mulongi, yikubokwadidi, mutala mwana wama wa yakala, mukuma mwana wama yandi mosi lwesi. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Kosu tangwa kitembu kimosi kisi mukwata, mu mbala mosi, wáyandika kukalunga, kyámuningisa ngolu yi kumulubwasa mafulu-fulu, amana kisi mukatuka mu phasi, kunima dya kumuzokisa yandi wosu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Yíbabokwadila balonguki baku ndangu bakukwasakya kaasi bálendaku.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu wáhumwakina: «Mbandu yakonda lukwikilu yi yavwalangana! Yi kuna khi tangwa yikwata kadiki yi benu yi kulutambwasaka? Mutwala mwana waku kwaku.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Bwana kakala bwesuka, kitembu kya mbi kyámubwisa ha tsi amana kyáyandika kumuningisa hika lawu. Kaasi Yesu, wákayakya kitembu kyambi, wámubelula mwana, wámuvutula phi kwena tata wandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Amana boosu báyituka kikuma kya kineni kya Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu wusamuni hika lufwa lwandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mth 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bwosu bakala yituka boosu mu mana kakala hanga, wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Kwena benu, tekikenu mboti matu ku ndinga zazi: Mwana wa mutu sanda bamulambula ku moku ma batu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Kaasi balonguki bábakisayoku ndinga yina: yákala yakububika kikuma kya bawu, ndangu babakulaku ntendula yandi, amana bweya bákala bwawu mu kumuyufula kikuma kya dyambu medina.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nati wena mbuta?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mth 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Balonguki bekatendana bawu yi bawu ndangu bazaya keti nati mbuta mu kati dya bawu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Amana Yesu bu kázaya kutendana kwákala mu mbundu za bawu, wátambula mwana, wámusya bela-bela yi yandi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>amana wábazimbwala: «Wuna wamúyamba mwana yandu, mu khumbu ya meni, meni-meni kayambini; amana wuna wangyámba meni, wumuyambi wuna wáthuma. Mukuma, wuna wenina wakhunda kuluta benu boosu, yandi wuna phi wenina mbuta.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuna wisiku lumenga, ha kimosi lwena yandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Kaasi Yowani wuzimbudi: «Mulongi, betu tumoniki mutu mosi wukakukwasaka bitembu bya mbi mu khumbu ya ngeyi, amana tusosiki kumukandisa, kikuma kisiku landa ngeyi ha kimosi yi betu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Kaasi Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Lumukandisabwoku, mukuma wuna kisiku lumenga, ha kimosi lwena yandi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hata dimosi dya ku Samadiya dibusi kumuyamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Bwosu byákala kwisalungila bilumbu bina kakala zanguka ku zilu, Yesu wábonga lukanu lwa ngolu lwa kukwenda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Amana wátuma bambambala ku thwala yandi. Baba babwa mu nzila amana bákota ku hata dimosi dya bisi Samadiya ndangu bamuyidikila kutula kwandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Kaasi bámuyambaku, kikuma ku Yelusalemi kakala kwenda. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Buna bámona bwana, balonguki bandi, Zyaki yi Yowani, bazonzi: «Pfumu, wuzodi ni twalomba kwena mbawu yatuka ku zilu ndangu yabazinisa?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu wábaluka kwena bawu amana wábakaya. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Amana benda ku hata dya hika.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bana batondi kulanda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mth 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Buna bákala muna nzila, mutu mosi wázimbula kwena Yesu: «Yikúlanda kwosu kuma kuna wakwénda.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu wávutula: «Mikengi myena yi binzenzi, banuni, ku zilu, bena phi yi mazamba, kaasi Mwana wa mutu, keku yi homa kazenza mutwa wandi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Amana wázimbula kwena mutu wa hika: «Ndanda.» Mutu yandu wávutula: «Pfumu, pheka muswa yenda zika theti tata wama.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Kaasi Yesu kámuzimbwala: «Yambula bamvumbi badizika bawu yi bawu, kaasi ngeyi ndawenda samuna Kipfumu kya Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Mukwawu kázimbula: «Pfumu, yikúlanda meni; kaasi pheka muswa yenda bonga theti ndenga kwena biwutu bya mu nzu yama.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesu wámuvutwala: «Wuna wusimbi tsengu mu kubundula, amana katala ku manima, kafwaniku mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutumi balonguki makumi tsambwadi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Pfumu wásola balonguki makumi tsambwadi yi boodi bahika, amana kábatuma bodi-bodi, ku thwala yandi, muna kosu mbanza yi kosu homa hana kafwana kenda yandi meni. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Kakala bazimbwala: «Mbutu ya lawu yenina, kaasi basadi, bakhunda. Mulombenu pfumu wa mbutu kahitika basadi mu mbutu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Ndalwenda! Yilutumi hanga bana ba mikoku hana kati dya bambwa-ngongu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Lunataku keti dikuta, keti waba, keti tsabatu; luhekaku mutu mboti mu nzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Muna nzu yosu yina lwakóta, samunenu theti: "Ngemba yakala mu nzu yayi." <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Amana yukani mwakala mutu mosi wa ngemba, ngemba ya benu yakála yi yandi; kondilo, yalúvutwakila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Nangenu muna nzu meni yayina, dyenu, nwenu phi bina balúheka; kikuma bulungi musadi katambula lufutu lwandi. Lwendaku nzu muna nzu. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Muna mbanza yosu yina lwakóta yi muna balúyamba, dyakenu bina balúheka; <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>bukenu bambefu bana bakala muna, amana bazimbwalenu: "Kipfumu kya Nzambi kibwesukini kwena benu." <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Kaasi muna kosu mbanza yina lwakóta, yuka baluyambiku, ndalwenda muna mabala-bala, zimbulenu: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>"Keti fusyangeni dya mbanza yenu dina dinamiki ku bitambi byetu, tukhukumunidya ndangu twaluvutwaladya. Zayenu phi ni Kipfumu kya Nzambi kibwesuki." <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Yiluzimbwadi ni mu kilumbu kina, phasi za Sotomu, za khunda zakála kuluta mbanza meni yina.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbanza zina zibusi kukwikila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mth 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Khi kyadi kwena ngeyi, Kolazini! Khi kyadi kwena ngeyi, Betisayita! Mukuma wadi biphadi bina byásalama theti kwena benu wadi ni byásalama ku Tidi yi ku Sitoni, tuka thama, wadi batu ba bawu, bákala bábalula bifu bya bawu, bavwata tsaki amana badifuba mu mbombi! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Ihana ni mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, phasi za Tidi yi Sitoni za khunda zákala kuluta benu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Amana ngeyi Kaphedinawuma, wadíthumba yi kuna zilu? Loni! Wakúlumuka yi kuna kalunga.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yesu wuzimbudi hika kwena balonguki: «Wuna wuluyukidi benu, wungyukidi meni, wuna wulubusi benu, wumbusi phi meni; amana wuna wumbusi meni, wumubusi phi wuna wáthuma.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka kwa balonguki makumi tsambwadi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Balonguki bana makumi tsambwadi yi boodi bávutuka yi kyesi, amana bázimbula: «Pfumu, keti bitembu bya mbi bitulemvwakidiki mu khumbu ya ngeyi!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Yikala mumona Satana kubwa ku zilu hanga mutsyenzya. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Talenu: yíluheka hamu dya kudyatikisa banyoka yi bikhala-khala yi ha thandu ya ngolu zoosu za mbeni, amana ka kima ku kyáfwana kuluhanga mbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ihana ni lusangwalaku kikuma kya bitembu bya mbi bilulemvwakidi; kaasi sangwalenu kikuma khumbu zenu zisonami mu mazilu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu sangwadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mth 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Yesu wázakama yi kyesi, mu lusadisu lwa Kitembu kyatoma, amana wázimbula: «Yikukumisi, Tata, Pfumu wa zilu yi tsi, kikuma wásweka mambu mama kwena batu badimuka yi batu ba ngangu, amana wásongilama kwena bana bakhunda. Yibwabuna Tata, kikuma bwabuna wátya mu tonda dyaku.»<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>«Byosu Tata wama wáphekabya. Amana ka mutu ku wuzayi nani kenina Mwana ho ka Tata ku, ka mutu ku phi wuzayi nati kenina Tata ho ka Mwana ku yi kwena mutu wuna kazodi, Mwana, kumusengwamina.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Wubaluki kwena balonguki, wábazimbwala mu kingenga: «Kyesi kwena mesu mana misi mona mambu mana lubati mona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Mukuma yiluzimbwadi ni bambikudi lawu yi bakyamvu bázola kumona mana lubati tala benu, kaasi bámonamoku, bázola kuyuka phi mana lubati yuka, kaasi báyukamoku.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya Musamadiya mosi wa mboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mulongi mosi wa mitsiku wátelama amana wámuhyula, ndangu kamumeka: «Mulongi, biki pfwani yihanga mu kutambula luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu kámuzimbwala: «Biki básonika mu mitsiku? Abweti wisi tanga?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Yandi wuvutudi: «"Watónda Pfumu Nzambi waku, yi mbundu yaku yosu, yi moya waku wosu, yi ngolu zaku zoosu, yi ngangu zaku zoosu". Amana khunda waku hanga ngeyi meni.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Amana Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Bwabuna wuvutudi. Hanga bwabuna, amana wazínga.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Kaasi yandi kázola kadinungisa, hanga wuhyudi kwena Yesu: «Amana nani wenina khunda wama?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu wávutwakila: «Mutu mosi wátuka ku Yelusalemi, wákulumuka ku Yediko; wábwa ha moku ma bandwandwa, bámutambula bima byosu, bámubeta amana bénda, bámusisa mu kulakana. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Nganga Nzambi mosi wakala kulumuka, bwana lwesi, muna nzila meni yina; wámumona, amana wutembi ku kyana. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Amana mutindu mosi, mulefi mosi wátula hakana, wámumona amana wátemba ku kyana. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Kaasi Musamadiya mosi wákala mu kitambu, wátula bela-bela yi yandi amana wámuyukila kiwayi kya lawu, buna kámumona. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Wábwesuka, wámuzunzila masi yi vinu muna phuta amana wámukasaza. Kunima, wámuzanzisa hana thandu ya Phunda wa yandi meni, wámunata ku nzu ya banzenza amana wámusadisa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Amana kilumbu kyálanda, wálubula mafwalanga modi, wáhanabya kwena mukwa nzu ya banzenza, amana wámuzimbwala: "Musadisa mutu yandu; amana byosu bina walútikisa, yíkuvutwalabya ha yikwisa vutwakisa."»<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Khi mutu, mu kati dya bawu batatu, fwani kakala khunda wa mutu wuna babeta kwena bandwandwa?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Mulongi wa mitsiku wuvutudi: «Wuna wámuyukila kyadi.» Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Ndawenda, amana ngeyi phi, sala bwabuna.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku nzu ya Malata yi Madiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Amana tangwa bákala muna nzila, Yesu yi balonguki bandi, wákota mu hata dimosi, amana mukhetu mosi, khumbu yandi Malata, wámuyamba kuna nzu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Myaki wandi wa mukhetu, bakala tela Madiya, kákala wasikuka ha kabeta muna malu ma Pfumu, yi kuhinikinaka phi ndinga yandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Malata yandi wudisakikiki mu bisalu bya lawu. Wisa kota amana wázimbula: «Pfumu, wubatiku mona kyadi bwana katsudikidiki, myaki wama wa mukhetu, kisalu meni hika? Muzimbwala ni katsadisa.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Pfumu wámuvutwala: «Malata, Malata, wubati nyengalakana yi kudiyangisa kikuma kya bima bya lawu, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>kaasi dyambu dimosi lwesi diluti mupfunu. Madiya wusodi dyambu dya bukheti dina bafwaniku bamubwotula.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Mutindu wa kulombila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mth 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu kakala lombila homa ha mosi. Tangwa kámanisa, mosi wa balonguki bandi wámuzimbwala: «Pfumu, tulonga kulombila, bwosu kálongabwa Yowani kwena balonguki bandi.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yandi wábazimbwala: «Tangwa lubati lombila, zimbulakenu bwabu»:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">"Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">khumbu yaku batomisaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Kipfumu kyaku kyisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Tuheka, lelu, madya metu ma kosu kilumbu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Tulolula mitsoki myetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">mukuma betu phi, tuloludi kwena batu boosu bana bisi tukota mitsoki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Amana tusadisa ndangu tubwaku mu phukumunu."<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Kábazimbwala hika bwabu: «Nati muna kati dya benu, wakála yi nduku wandi, amana kamuyendila muna kati dya kisuku, mu kumuzimbwala: "Nduku, ndefisa khwanga tatu; <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>mukuma mosi wa banduku bama wutuki mu kitambu, wuthudidi kuna nzu, amana yeku yi kima yimúheka." <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Amana yuka ni, muna kati, mukwawu kamuvutwala: "Yambula kutsya malokosi! Mwelu wakubindika wenina, bana bama yi meni-meni ha thangi thwenina; pfwaniku yivumbuka kikuma kya kukuheka khwanga." <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Yiluzimbwadibwa ni, yuka kavumbukiku mu kumuhekama, kikuma nduku wandi kenina, kavúmbuka kikuma kya nziki-nziki yina kasikhokwatila amana kamúheka kyosu kina kavi mupfunu. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Amana meni, yiluzimbwadi ni lombenu, amana balúheka, sandenu amana lwaséngumuna, khokwatilenu amana balúyafwadila. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Mukuma mutu wosu wuna wisi lomba, bisi muheka; wuna wisi sanda, kisi sengumuna; amana phi kwena wuna wisi khokwatila, bayáfulula. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Khi tata mu kati dya benu, yukani mwana wandi kamulomba tsema, amana kamuheka nyoka ha kifulu kya tsema? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Kondilo, yuka kalomba dyaki, kamuheka kikhala-khala? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Yukani benu bakholwa, lwazayaka kuheka bima bya bukheti kwena bana benu, Tata wenina kuna zilu, kahána phi Kitembu Kyatoma kwena bana bisikya mulomba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutu ya Yesu kwena bambeni bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mth 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Yesu kakala kukwasa kitembu kya mbi kyáhonda mutu kamama. Ha kyálubuka kitembu kya mbi, mukwa kamama wázonza. Amana mulumba-lumba wa batu wáyituka. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Kaasi batu bahika bázimbula bwabu: «Mu hamu dya Belezebula, pfumu wa biphidi-mutu, kabati kukwasila biphidi-mutu.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Amana bahika, mu kumuleya, hanga bamulombi kiphadi kyatuka ku zilu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Amana bwosu kázaya mabanza ma bawu, wábazimbwala: «Kipfumu kyosu kina kyadíkabisa kyawu meni, kyazíluka, nzu zawúlumuka zimosi ha thandu ya zikwawu. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Honi Satana kakala wadikabisa yandi meni, abweti kipfumu kyandi kyazyamina? Kikuma lubati zonza ni mu hamu dya Belezebula mbati kukwasila biphidi-mutu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Amana yukani meni, mu hamu dya Belezebula mbati kukwasila biphidi-mutu, bana benu, mu hamu dya nati bisi kukwasilabya? Ihana bakádila bawu meni bazusi benu! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Kaasi yukani mu mulembu wa Nzambi yisi kukwasila biphidi-mutu, kisongidila ni Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyisa kedi yi kuna kwa benu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Yukani mutu wa ngolu, wenina yi binwaninu, muna kati dya nzu yandi, bima byandi byosu byenina bya kusweka mboti-mboti. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Kaasi yukani mosi wahika wumuluti yandi mu ngolu kisa tula, amana kamubeta, kamúbotula binwaninu byosu bina kakala sila mbundu, fwani phi kabisibya bima bina kamubongi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>«Wuna weku yi meni, yandi mutendi wama; amana wuna kisiku khoka yi meni, kisi mwanga.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka kwa kitembu kya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mth 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Tangwa kilubuki kitembu kya mbi mu kati dya mutu, kisi luta mu kati dya tseki, kyasanda homa ha kulembwila. Amana bwosu kimonihoku, kidizimbwadini: "Yikwenda vutuka, muna nzu yama, muna yílubuka." <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Amana ha kyatúla, kiwani nzu ya kukombula bukheti yi yakunenga. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Hanga, kyendi amana kitambudi bitembu bikwawu tsambwadi bya mbi kuluta kyawu. Bikoti mwamuna amana bisikidi. Tsuka-tsuka, khadidi ya mutu wuna yekina hika ya mbi lawu, kuluta yina yatheti.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyesi kya kyedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Buna kakala zonza bwana, mukhetu mosi wáthuta ndinga hana kati dya mulumba-lumba wa batu amana wámuzimbwala: «Kyesi kwena kundu dina dyákuyimita yi mayeni mana mákuyemika!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Kaasi yandi wávutula: «Kyesi, kaasi kyesi kya lawu kwena bana bisi yuka ndinga ya Nzambi amana bisiya sadila.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulomba kwa kidimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mth 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Bwosu wakala basa mulumba-lumba wa batu, yandi wáyandika kuzimbula: «Mbandu yayi, ya mbi yenina! Yibati lomba kidimbu. Batámbulaku kidimbu kya hika, kaka kyakina kya Yonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Mukuma, bwosu kákala, Yonasi, kidimbu kikuma kya bisi Ninive, phila mosi Mwana wa mutu kakála kidimbu kikuma kya mbandu yayi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Pfumu wa mukhetu wa ku banda katélama, mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, ha kimosi yi batu ba mbandu yayi, amana kabáfunda, kikuma yandi, mu binzunga bya kyana bya tsi kátuka kikuma kya kuyuka mudimu wa Solumoni. Kinga yandi wenina haha, wuluti Solumoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Batu ba ku Ninive batélama, kilumbu kya pfundusu, ha kimosi yi mbandu yayi, amana bafúndaya, kikuma bawu básoba bikalulu, mu malongi ma Yonasi. Kinga yandu wenina haha, wuluti Yonasi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwinda wa lutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mth 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Ka mutu ku walemisa mwinda kikuma kya kuswekawa holo kusyawa ku tsi ya nzungu ya tuma; kaasi bisiwa sya hana muzanga; ndangu bana bakóta bamona kyesesi. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Disu dyaku dyena mwinda wa lutu; yukani disu dyaku dyakala bukheti, lutu lwaku lwosu lwakuyinika lwenina; kaasi yukani dyakukala dyafwa, lutu lwaku phi mu phipha lwenina. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ihana ni zaya kulunda kyesesi kina kyenina mwena ngeyi ndangu kikalaku phipha. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Honi lutu lwaku lwosu lwena lwa kuyinika, konda kukala keti kitini kimosi mu phipha, lwakála lwosu mu mwini, hanga mwinda wukulemini mu mitsyenzya myandi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bafundi Bafwadisi yi Balongi ba mitsiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mth 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Buna kakala zonza, mufwadisi mosi mutedisi kenda dya ku nzu yandi. Yesu wákota, wénda hana mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mufwadisi wáyituka mu kumona ni Yesu kadisukudiku, bwosu buna myakala lomba mitsiku mya bawu, ku thwala kudya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Kaasi Pfumu kámuzimbwala: «Benu, Bafwadisi, lwisi semisa phenza ya kopha yi ya longa, kaasi ku tsya mbundu, lwabasa yi nzala bwifi yi khu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Batu bakonda ngangu! Wuna wáhanga phenza, ka yandi ku phi wáhanga kati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Kaasi hanakenu hanga makabu ma khenda, bina byena mu kati, amana byosu byakála bya kasemi kikuma kya benu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Kaasi khi kyadi kwena benu, Bafwadisi, kikuma lwisi futa kimosi kya kumi kya khaya za tsudi ya kitoku yi zina za mu musitu yi ndunda zoosu za khunda-khunda. Kaasi lwisi lenza masonga yi lungongu lwa Nzambi. Mamana mambu mafwani kusalaka, konda kuzimbakana mana masadini.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, Bafwadisi, kikuma lwisi tonda kuzakala ha kiti kya theti, mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta yi kubongaka mboti mu mazandu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Khi kyadi kwena benu! Kikuma lwena hanga mazyamu malamba amana batu bisi dyatama hana thandu konda kuzaya.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mosi wa balongi ba mitsiku wámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, mu kuzonza bwabuna, wututukwani betu phi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Amana yandi wávutula: «Khi kyadi kwena benu phi balongi ba mitsiku! Mukuma lwisi longidila, kwena batu, bizitu bya phasi mu kunata, amana lwisibyoku simba, benu-benu, keti ku mulembu wumosi. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Khi kyadi kwena benu! Lwisi tunga mazyamu ma bambikudi, kinga batata benu bábahonda! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Ihana lubati ta kimbangi, amana lubati sikununa mihangu mya batata benu, mukuma bawu báhonda bambikudi, amana ihana benu lwisima batungila! <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ihana ni mudimu wa Nzambi wuzimbudi: "Mbati hitika bambikudi yi bathumwa; amana bahika hana kati dya bawu, babáhonda, babányokuna phi." <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Ndangu bafutisa, kwena mbandu yayi, menga ma bambikudi boosu, mana mátyakana tuka ku luyanduku lwa tsi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>tuka ku menga ma Abelu tii yikuna menga ma Zakadiya, wuna báhonda ha kati dya mesa ma kimenga yi nzu ya Nzambi. Kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa, bafútisama kwena mbandu yayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu balongi ba mitsiku! Kikuma lwákatula tsabi ya mazaya; benu-benu lukotiku, amana bana bazola kukota, lwábakandikisa.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Tangwa kálubuka kwakuna, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi báyandika kumulundika yi kumuhyula mambu ma phila yi phila; <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>bámuleya ndangu bamukwata mu dyambu dimosi dyalubuka mu munwa wandi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Bana bisi disamuna ni bakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mth 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, mulumba-lumba wa batu wáwongama mu mafunda kumi-kumi, hanga batu bekadidyatikisa bawu yi bawu. Yesu wáyandika kuzimbula, theti, kwena balonguki bandi: «Dikengenu yi muvimbu wa Bafwadisi, wuna wa disu ku tsi ya lukaya. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Amana heku kima kyáswamana, kyakonda sengumuka; ka kima ku kya kitsweki kyakonda zayakana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Yi hakana ni mambu moosu lwazónza mu kisuku, mayúkalakana mu kati dya mwini; amana mana lwafwéta mu matu, mu masuku ma kuphata, mayúkalakana mu ndinga ya ngolu, mu midilu mya nzu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuna bafwani kubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mth 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Yiluzimbwadibwa, kwena benu banduku bama ni lubangaku bana bisi honda lutu kaasi kunima dya bwana, bafwaniku kusala kima kiluti. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Yilúsongila nani lufwani kubanga: Bangenu mutu wuna wena ti kunima dya kuhonda, kena yi hamu dya kululosa ku bilungi. Yi bwabuna, yiluzimbwadibwa ni yandi lufwani kubanga!»<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«Luzayibwoku ni makyokya matanu balendama tekisa mu mafwalanga modi? Kinga keti mosi hana kati dya mawu, kazimbakaniku ku thwala ya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Keti tsuki za mutwa myenu, zoosu za kutanga zenina. Lubangaku, lwena mupfunu, kuluta lawu dya banuni ba khunda!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutambwasa ho kubwisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mth 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>«Yiluzimbwadibwa ni wuna wathámbwasa ku thwala ya batu, Mwana wa mutu kamútambwasa phi ku thwala ya banzyo ba Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Kaasi wuna wathúna ku thwala ya batu, bamútuna ku thwala banzyo ba Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Wosu wuna wazónza mbi kikuma kya Mwana wa mutu, kalóluka; kaasi kwena wuna wasáwula Kitembu Kyatoma, kalólukaku.»<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Amana tangwa balúnata mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, keti ku thwala ya bapfumu yi bambuta, mu kulusambisa, ludiyangisaku kikuma kya phila yina lwadíthatumuna, keti buna lwazímbula, <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>mukuma, Kitembu Kyatoma kalúlonga, muna tangwa medina, mana mafwani kuzimbula.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mvwama wa konda mayedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mutu mosi, muna kati dya mulumba-lumba, wámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, muzimbwala phangi wama twakabana yi meni kuvwa kwetu.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Mukwetu, nati wungyadiki meni zusi dya benu holo mukabudi wa kuvwa kwenu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Hanga wubazimbwadi: «Dikengenu mu lukusu lwa mbongu, mukuma keti mu kuvwa kwa lawu, luzingu lwa mutu lweku mu bima byandi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kahanga wubatidi kingana kimosi: «Mafu ma mutu mosi wa mvwama hanga malubudi mbutu ya lawu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Kakala yindula amana wudizonzidi: "Biki yihánga? Mukuma yeku yi homa hafwani mu kulumbika mbutu yama." <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Hanga wuzonzi hika: "Tala buna yihánga: Yimwanga khila zama, amana thungi za hika za mbuta; ndangu yilumbika ngenza zama zoosu yi bima byama bya hika. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Amana yidizonzidi: Moya wama, bima bya lawu wenina byawu bya kusweka kikuma kya mvula za lawu; lembwa kwaku, dya, nwa amana ta mukinzi." <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Kaasi Nzambi wumuzimbwadi: "Zoba dya mutu! Mu phipha meni yayi bakúlombalwa luzingu lwaku. Amana bima byabi wulumbiki, byana byákala?» <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«Phila mosi bwena kwena mutu wuna wisi lumbika kimvwama kikuma kya yandi meni; kaasi keku mvwama kikuma kya Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusya mbundu mwena Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mth 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Kunima Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Ihana yibati luzimbwala: Ludiyangisakaku kikuma kya luzingu lwenu ni biki lwadya, keti kikuma kya lutu lwenu, ni biki lwavwáta. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Mukuma, luzingu luluti kudya, amana lutu luluti muledi. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Simbululenu Bangandwanganga: bisiku kuna, bisiku hela; beku keti fuka, keti khila, amana Nzambi kisi badisa! Kinga benu, lwenina yi mupfunu wa lawu, kuhyoka banuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nati muna kati dya benu, mu nyengi dyandi, fwani kaleyisa keti koma ka luzingu lwandi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Yuka ni lubatiku lenda keti dyambu dya khunda, kikuma kya biki lubati diyangisila mu mambu mana masadini? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Simbululenu bithundu buna bisi lubuka: byawu byisiku sala, bisiku tunga muledi; kaasi yiluzimbwadibwa ni keti Solumoni, muna khembu yandi yosu, kávwataku hanga bithundu bina. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Yukani Nzambi kavwatisaka bwana mwangu wenina lelu mu bilanga amana mbasi balosiwa ku mbawu, mukyedika, kahángabwa kikuma kya benu phi, batu ba lukwikilu lwakhunda! <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Amana benu, lusandaku bina lwadya keti bina lwanwa, lukalaku phi yi kiwayi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Kikuma yibyana bima bisi sanda, konda kulembwa, batu ba tsi yosu bana bakondi zaya Nzambi. Kaasi benu, Tata wenu wuzayi ni mupfunu biluyenina. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Sandenu benu theti Kipfumu kya Nzambi, amana balúkosikila bikwawu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuswekila bimvwama ku zilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mth 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Bangaku, koma ka kibuka kya mikoku! Mukuma busephidisi kwena Tata wenu mu kuluheka Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Tekisenu kuvwa kwenu amana hanenukwa mu makabu ma khenda. Diyidikilenu benu-benu tsaki za makuta mana misiku zangana, kimvwama kina kisiku mana mu mazilu, kuna keti mwifi mosi kisiku tula, amana keti tseledi mosi kadyakyoku. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Mukuma, hana henina kimvwama kyenu, hahana hakála mbundu yenu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batsinzidi ba kitsungila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Kalakenu bayilama, mukaba muna luketu amana mwinda myenu mya kulemisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Amana kalenu hanga batu babati hingila ni pfumu wa bawu, kavutuka ku mukinzi wa longu; ndangu bamukangwala ha kakwisa khokwatila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Kyesi kwena basadi bana kawána pfumu, mu kutula kwandi, bakála batokama! Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa ni kavwáta yameni miledi mya kisalu, kabáheka kifulu ha mesa, amana kakwisa basila bima. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Kisa mu kisuku holo mu khoku watheti, yukani kabawana bwabuna, khi kyesi kwena bawu!»<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>«zayenubwoku mboti ni wadi mukwa nzu kazayaka khi tangwa kakwísa mwifi, kakhanaku yambwadila bakota mu nzu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Benu phi, kalenu bayilama, mukuma Mwana wa mutu kakwísa mu tangwa dina lukondi yindula.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musadi wa bukheti yi wa mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mth 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Hanga Phetelu wáhyula: «Pfumu, wuti kingana kina kikuma kya betu lwesi ho kikuma kya batu boosu?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Amana Pfumu wávutula: «Nati kalema wa ngangu yi wuna bisi sila mbundu? Wuna kenda sanda pfumu wandi amana wámuheka kiyeka kya kutadikilaka nzu yi basadi bahika mukusya ni kabahekaka ndambu ya bawu ya madya mu tangwa dina difwani. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Kyesi kwena musadi wuna yukani pfumu, mu kutula kwandi, kisa muwana muna kisalu meni kina! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: kamúswanika kalenga talaka bima byandi byosu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Kaasi ho musadi wuna kadizonzila: "Pfumu wama zingididi mu kukwisa", kayandika kubabetaka basadi ba bayakala yi basadi ba bakhetu; kadyaka, kanwaka amana kazelaka malafu, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>pfumu wa musadi meni yayina kakwísa kilumbu kimosi kina kamuhingidiku yandi yi mu tangwa dina kazayiku; amana pfumu kamúheka ndola yiluti kitesu kunima, kamúsya mu kanga dya bana bisiku lemvuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Musadi wuna wisi dizayila luzolu lwa pfumu wandi, kaasi konda kuyidika kima holo konda kusala luzolu lwa pfumu wandi, bamuzyatwasa mafimbu ma lawu. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Kaasi, musadi wuna wukondibwa zaya amana kisi hanga mambu mana mafwani mamuzyatwasa, katámbula mafimbu ma khunda. Kwena wuna báheka lawu, bámulomba phi lawu; kwena wuna báswekisa lawu, bamúlomba hika kuluta.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, kisina kya ngyengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mth 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Yisa sya mbawu ha tsi; bwosu thondibwa ni yatekila lema! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Yena yi mbotika yimosi mu kutambula amana mbundu ha thandu yingyena tii yi kuna bwalungila! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Benu lubanzi ni ngemba yisa nata ha tsi? Loni, kaasi yiluzimbwadibwa ni ngyengu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Mukuma tuka buthwena, batu batanu, muna nzu yimosi bahámbana, batatu mu kimbeni yi bodi amana bodi mu kimbeni yi batatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Bakala badihambula: tata mu kimbeni yi mwana wa yakala, amana mwana wa yakala mu kimbeni yi tata, ngudi mu kimbeni yi mwana wandi wa mukhetu amana mwana wa mukhetu mu kimbeni yi ngudi, buko bwa mukhetu mu kimbeni yi mukhetu wa mwana wandi amana mukhetu wa mwana mu kimbeni yi buko bwandi bwa mukhetu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubakula bidimbu bya matangwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mth 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu kázonza hika kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu: «Tangwa lwisi mona tuti dimosi tungamu kuna mazyokidi ma tangwa, lwisi zonza: "Mvula wisi," amana bwana bulungidi. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Amana tangwa yisi fula pfunzi ya ku banda, lwisi zonza: "Mwini lawu kwakála", amana bwana bulungidi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Bakavungalosi! Luzayi kubanguna mitindu mya tsi yi mya zilu; amana abweti lwisiku lenda kubakula mutindu wa tangwa dyadi?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyukana yi mbeni waku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mth 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>«Amana kikuma kya biki lwisiku zengila mwena benu-benu mambu mana mena masungama? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Tangwa lwendi mu kibangi yi mbanda waku ku nganda, dikasikisa lwayukana yandi buna lwenina mu nzila. Sandaku ni mbanda waku kakunata ku thwala banganzi, amana nganzi wukulambudi kwena baphumbulu, baphumbulu ndangu bakutimbula mu luzumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Yikuzimbwadibwa ni mwamuna walúbukamwoku yuka ni khaku kedi wufuta pfuka yina yi kuna dikuta dya tsuka.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kubalula mbundu ho kufwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Muna tangwa medina, ndambu ya batu bámenika kwena Yesu buna kátuma mbala yimosi Philatu batu mu kuhonda bisi Ngadidi bamosi bana bakala yoka mikhayilu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yandi wubavutwadi: «Benu lubanzi ni bakwa Ngadidi meni babana, basumuki bákala kuluta bisi Ngadidi bahika, kikuma kya buna banyokuki mu mutindu wuna? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Loni, yiluzimbwadibwa; kaasi ho ni lubaludiku bikalulu byenu, lwazíluka benu boosu hanga bawu. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Ho phi lo, batu bana kumi yi nana bábwila kibaka kya kaleyi kya Silowe kina kyábahonda phi, lubanzi basumuki bákala kuluta batu boosu bahika ba ku Yelusalemi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Loni, yiluzimbwadibwa; kaasi ho ni lubaludiku bikalulu byenu, phila mosi lwafwa benu boosu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mufiki wákonda ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Yesu wábatila kingana kyaki: «Mutu mosi kákala yi miti, wafwanana yi mumanga, bisi tela ni mufiki kákuna muna kilanga kyandi kya vinu. Wisa sanda kibundu kya fiki kwakuna, kaasi káwanakyoku. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Hanga wuzonzi kwena musadi wa vinu: "Tala, mvula tatu kedi yisi kwisa sanda kibundu kya fiki ku mufiki wawu, amana yisikyoku wana. Kisongidila, kwangawa! Kikuma kya biki wisa tambula mafu ma khatu konda kikuma? <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Musadi wa vinu wumuvutwadi: "Pfumu, yambwadilawa hika mvula yayi; tangwa yisíma hika mu kabeta amana yimana sya mvumvu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Mbanzi, walenda ha bibundu mvula yakwísa; holo, wakwángawa.»<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mukhetu mu kilumbu kimosi kya sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Kilumbu kimosi kya sabata, Yesu kakala longa muna mosi ya nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Kinga mukhetu mosi wa mbefu wákala hana, báloka mulumba kwena kitembu kya mbi, tuka mvula kumi yi nana; wavwembama kákala amana kakalaku lenda kuvumbuka buna bufwani. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Tangwa kámumona Yesu, wámutela amana wázimbula: «Mukhetu, wukutumuki mu kimbefu kyaku.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Amana wámuthetika moku. Muna mbala mosi mukhetu wásungama amana wuyandiki kuzatula Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Kaasi pfumu wa nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, kásephilaku kikuma Yesu wálungisa kubelula kuna, mu kilumbu kya sabata. Wuzimbudi kwena kibuka kya batu kina kyákala hakana: «Hena yi bilumbu bisambanu bya kisalu, alwisa dibukisaka muna bilumbu meni byabina, kaasi lwisaku mu kilumbu kya sabata.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Pfumu wumuvutwadini: «Ha lwenina benu bakavungalosi, kosu mutu wa benu kisiku kutumuna ngombi kondilo ane<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna bikalulu bya bikanda byahika, mbisi wuna ane bakala musadila hanga mbisi wuna wisi tikula mazitu. Kenina wakhunda kuluta baphunda bana bakodini. Bisi muzayila muna matu mandi ma kaleyi. Ane kenina kidimbu kya kudikulumuna kwa Masiya.</char></note> wandi muna dinda, mu kilumbu kya sabata, mu kumunata ndangu benda munwisa mamba? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Amana mukhetu yandu, mwana kena muna butuka dya Bulahami, amana Satana wámukasa tuka mvula kumi yi nana, kisongidila bulungiku ni bamukutumuna misinga myandi, mu kilumbu kya sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Buna kakala zonza bwabuna, bana bakala mutendisa tsoni zábakwata; amana kibuka kyosu basephidi kikuma kya mambu moosu ma khembu kakala hanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya ngenza za mutadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mth 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yesu kakala zimbula: «Yi biki kifwanakani Kipfumu kya Nzambi? Yi biki pfwani yifwanikisakya? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kifwanakani yi ngenza ya tidi kábonga mutu mosi amana wátimbulaya muna masamba mandi; yimeni, yákituka miti, amana banuni ba ku zilu bisa tunga mazamba ma bawu muna mihandi myandi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya muvimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mth 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesu wuzimbudi hika: «Yi biki pfwani yifwanikisa Kipfumu kya Nzambi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kifwanakani yi muvimbu kábonga, mukhetu mosi, amana wákotisa muna ndambu ya pfuba tii yi kuna kyáthutumuka kithoba kyosu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwelu wafitakana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mth 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">7:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu kakala luta mavula yi mahata yi kwendalongaka musamu wa Nzambi kinzila-nzila mu kukwenda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Mutu mosi wámuhyula: «Pfumu, batu ba khunda lwesi bahúluka?» Yesu wábavutwala: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>Syenu khwakasu lwakotila ku mwelu wafitakana; mukuma, yiluzimbwadi ni, balawu basánda mu kukota amana baléndabwoku.<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>«Buna katelama mukwa nzu amana kayáfikila mwelu, kuna benu, lwasala ku nzila, lwayándika kukhokwatila kuna mwelu yi kuzonzaka: "Pfumu, tuyafwadila!" Kalúvutwala: "Benu, nzayiku keti ku biki lutuki!" <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Hanga luyandiki kuzimbula: "Twakala dya yi kunwa ku thwala ngeyi, amana ngeyi wakala longa muna nzila za mbuta za mavula ma betu." <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Amana kalúvutwala: "Nzayiku keti ku biki lutuki. Halukenu yi meni, benu boosu lwisi hanga mbi!" <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Hahana kwakála bidilu yi makwenzi, tangwa lwamóna Bulahami, Kizaki, Yakobi yi bambikudi boosu muna Kipfumu kya Nzambi, amana balúkukwasa ku nzila! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Batúka ku tsosu yi ku ndamba, ku londi yi ku banda mu kutambula kifulu ku mesa mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Amana, hakála yi batu batsuka batékila, amana batu batheti, basúkinina.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mth 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Muna tangwa medina, ndambu ya Bafwadisi bisa muzimbwala: «Ndawenda, katuka haha, mukuma Eloti kabati tonda kukuhonda.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Wubavutwadi: «Ndenu lwenda zimbula kwena mukengi wuna wa nduka za mbi: "Yikúkwasa biphidi-mutu amana mbeludi lelu yi mbasi; kilumbu kya tatu mbanisibya." <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Kaasi bufwani yilanda nzila yama lelu, mbasi yi kilumbu kyalanda; mukuma bufwaniku ni mbikudi bamuhondila kuma kwahika ho ka ku Yelusalemi ku.»<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yelusalemi, Yesulusalemi, ngeyi wisi honda bambikudi yi kuhondila ku matadi bana bisi kuhitika! Mbala kwa nzodi kedi kukutikisa bana baku bwosu kisi kutikisa, ngudi wa khoku, bana bandi ku tsi ya mahela mandi, kaasi lwázolabwoku! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Yi bwabuna, nzu yenu yikituki yamba. Yiluzimbwadibwa ni lwambónaku kedi tii yi kuna dyakwísila tangwa dina lwazímbula: Kasakumuka wuna wukwisa mu khumbu ya Pfumu!»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu buki mutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Kilumbu kimosi kya sabata, Yesu wisa dya ku nzu ya mosi wa bapfumu ba Bafwadisi, amana bawu bakala musimbulula yi tsikiningi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Mukwa maladi ma zatu mosi wákala kuna thwala yandi. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu wuhyudi kwena Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku: «Mitsiku mibati hana muswa ho lo, wa kubuka mutu mu kilumbu kya sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Kaasi báhwena talala. Hanga wumubongi mbefu, wámubuka amana wámusula kenda. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Kunima, wábazimbwala: «Nati ha kati dya benu, yukani mwana wandi ho lo ngombi wandi kabwa mu buku dimosi, kakonda mulubula yi tswatsu, mu kilumbu kya sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Kaasi bálendaku kuvutula ku kyufu kina.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phila ya kusola kifulu yi phila kutedisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu wáta kingana kwena batu bana bátedisa, kikuma kámona buna bakala sola bifulu bya theti. Kábazimbwala: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Yukani bakutela, kwena mutu, ku mikinzi mya longu, wendaku dizakadisa ha kifulu kya theti. Hakala nana ni mutu mosi kuhyoki ngeyi mu lukumu kátedisiki; <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>amana, wuna wulutedisiki benu boodi, kisa kuzimbwala: "Sisila yandi kifulu." Tsoni wayúka mu kwenda dizakadisa ku kifulu kya tsuka. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Kaasi tangwa bákutedisi, ndawenda sikuka ku kifulu kya tsuka, ndangu mu tangwa dina kakwísa wuna kutedisiki, kakuzimbwala: "Nduku wama, tombuka ku thwala." Amana bwakála kikuma kya ngeyi lukumu ku thwala batu boosu bana bakála ku mesa ha kimosi yi ngeyi. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Kikuma, "wuna wadítombula bamukulumuna; amana wuna wadíkulumuna, bamútombula.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Yesu wázimbula phi kwena wuna wámutedisa: «Tangwa wisi hana madya ma mu suka keti ma mu masikidika, wutedisaku banduku baku, keti baphangi baku, keti bakwa kikanda kyaku, keti bamvwama babana lwabandakana bawu; bakuvutwala nana, kilumbu kina kyakála kya bawu, hanga bakuvutwadi ngeyi phi buna wubasadidi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Kaasi yuka ni wuzodi kuta mukinzi, tedisa baphutu yi bakwa bifu bya mutindu yi mutindu yi bifwa malu yi moku phi yi baphofu. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Wakála yi kyesi, kikuma beku yi kima bakuvutwala. Mukuma, wafútama tangwa bafútumuka batu basungama.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukinzi wa mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mth 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Buna káyuka bwabuna, mosi wa batu bana bakala ku mesa wázimbula kwena Yesu: «Kyesi kwena mutu wuna wadya mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yandi wámuvutwala: «Mutu mosi wáta mukinzi wa mbuta, amana wátedisa lawu dya batu. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Mu tangwa dya kudya, wátuma musadi wandi kenda bazimbwala batu bana kátedisa yandi: "Alwisenu! Bima byosu bya kuyidika kedi byena." <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Kaasi bawu boosu, mutu yi mutu, kakala lomba ndoluka. Watheti kámuzimbwala: "Kilanga kimosi thuki mu kusumba, buluti mboti, yenda talakya; ndolula." <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Mukwawu kámuzimbwala: "Bangombi kumi thuki mu kusumba, yendi bameka phi; Yikulombibwa, wandolula." <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wahika wuzimbudi: "Buthwena khwediki, pfwaniku kwisa." <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Musadi, mu kuvutuka, wázimbula mambu mana kwena pfumu wandi. Hanga pfumu wa nzu, mu khabu, wuzimbudi kwena musadi wandi: "Awenda tswatsu muna mabala-bala ma mbuta keti mana ma khunda, ma mbanza, amana nata kwaku baphutu yi batu bana bena yi bifu bya lutu, mutindu yi mutindu yi bifwa mesu yi bana bisi tinguna." <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Hanga kunima, musadi wisa zimbula: "Pfumu, buna wulombiki busalami, kaasi bizika bisadi hika bya khatu." <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Hanga pfumu wuzimbudi kwena musadi: "Awenda muna nzila yi mu mikinda mya bilanga, balundika batu mu kukota ndangu nzu yama yabasa. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Mukuma, yiluzimbwadibwa: ka mosi ku, wa batu bana bátedisa wayédika madya ma meni."»<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abweti kukituka mulonguki wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mth 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Milumba-lumba mya batu myakala kangala yi Yandi. Yandi wubaluki amana wubazimbwadi: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Yuka mutu wisi kwena meni amana konda kabwisa tata wandi yi ngudi wandi yi mukhetu wandi yi bana bandi yi baphangi bandi ba bayakala yi baphangi ba bakhetu, keti luzingu lwa yandi meni, kafwaniku kukala mulonguki wa meni. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Wuna wukondi nata kitakani kyandi amana kandanda, kafwaniku kukala mulonguki wa meni. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Amana nati hana kati dya benu, wázola katunga nzu ya musyetebengi, wakonda zakala theti kikuma kya kutala ho mbongu zafwana kena zawu mu kumanisina kisalu. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Kondilo, kunima dya kusikula mupfundila, konda kalenda kumanisaya, amana bana boosu bakwisa mumona bakonda museya <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>mu kuzimbula: "Mutu yandu wáyandika kutunga kaasi kálendaku mu kumanisa!" <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Holo, khi pfumu, yuka ni kendanwana yi pfumu wahika, kazakalaku theti mu kudihyula yuka wufwani, yi bayakala mafunda kumi, kunwanisa wuna wubati kwisa ku thwala yandi yi mafunda makumodi? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Yuka loni, buna kenina hika wuna kyana, kamútumina mbambala mu kulomba ngemba. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yi bwabuna ni, ha kati dya benu, wuna wukondi kudibwisa yi bima byandi byosu kapfwaniku kala mulonguki wa meni.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa wakonda mupfunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mth 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Mungwa kima kya mboti. Kaasi honi munzenzu wukondi, yi biki bavútwalawa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Weku hika mboti keti kikuma kya mafu, keti kikuma kya mvumvu; bisiwa losa ku nzila. Wuna wena yi matu ma kuyuka, kayuka!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukoku watota, wumoniki phi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mth 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Bakalaki ba phaku yi basumuki boosu, bábwesuka kwena Yesu ndangu bamuyuka. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku bázimbula mu kumukumba: «Kisi yamba basumuki, kisi dya ha kimosi yi bawu!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Hanga Yesu wábatila kingana kyaki: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Khi mutu ha kati dya benu, yuka kákala yi mikoku khama, amana katotisa wumosi, kasísaku makumi vwa yi vwa mahika muna nganga ndangu kenda sanda wuna wutotiki, tii yi kuna kaséngumunawa? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Amana buna kaséngumunawa, kasyáwa ha mahembu mandi yi kyesi kyosu. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Amana mu kuvutuka ku nzu yandi, kátela banduku yi bana kábandakana bawu mu kubazimbwala: "Sangwalenu yi meni, mukuma tsengumuniwa mukoku wama wuna wátota!" <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Yiluzimbwadi: "Phila mosi, kyesi kya lawu kyakála mu zilu, kikuma kya musumuki mosi wubaludi mbundu, kuluta batu bana basungama makumi vwa yi vwa bana beku yi mupfunu wa kubalula mbundu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kibendi kya makuta kyátota, kimoniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«Holo, khi mukhetu, yuka kakala yi bibendi kumi amana katotisa kibendi kimosi, kakwikaku yi mwinda, kakombulaku nzu amana wusandi bukheti-bukheti, yi kuna kamónikya? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Buna kamónakya, katédisa kuna nzu yandi, banduku yi bakhetu bana kábandakana bawu, amana mu kabázimbwala: "Sangwalenu yi meni kikuma tsengumunikya kibendi kya makuta kina yítotisa!" <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Phila mosi, yiluzimbwadibwa, kyesi bwena ku thwala banzyo ba Nzambi kikuma kya musumuki mosi wubaludi mbundu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana wátota amana wumoniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu kázimbula hika: «Mutu mosi wákala yi bana bodi ba bayakala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Amana wuna wa muleki kuluta wázimbula kwena tata wandi: "Tata, pheka ndambu ya kimvwama yina pfwani yibonga." Hanga tata wukabisi kuvwa kwandi kwena bawu. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Amana kunima koma ka bilumbu, mwana wuna wa muleki, wábalula mu makuta bima byosu bina kakala byawu, amana wénda ku tsi yimosi ya kyana. Kwakuna, wázanga kimvwama kyandi mu luzingu lwa kisaka-saka. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Buna kámanisa byosu, nzala ya lawu yákota muna tsi meni yana, amana wáyandika kukonda mu byosu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Wádikotisa ku kisalu kya mutu mosi, wa ku tsi meni yayina, wámutuma muna bilanga byandi mu kuhungula bangulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Amana kázola bwabuna ndangu kayukutaka mu bibundu bina bakala dya bangulu, kaasi keti mutu kámuhekabyoku. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Muna kati dya yandi meni, kádizimbwala: "Bakwa, basadi ba tata wama, benina yi mapha malutuki, amana meni, haha, mbati fwa ku nzala? <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Yitélama, yikwénda kwena tata wama amana yimúzimbwala: Tata, yísumuka ku thwala Nzambi yi ku thwala ngeyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Pfwaniku hika mu kuthela mwana waku. Mbongila hanga mosi wa basadi baku." <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Amana wátelama mu kukwenda kwena tata wandi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Buna kákala kuna kyana, tata wandi mumoni amana wuyuki kiwayi kya lawu: wénda thinu, wámubumbakana amana wámuyamba phi. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwana kámuzimbwala: "Tata, yísumuka ku thwala Nzambi yi ku thwala ngeyi. Pfwaniku hika kukala hanga mwana waku wa kubuta." <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Kaasi tata wázimbula kwena basadi bandi: "Natenu tswatsu mvwela yina yiluti bukheti amana muvwatisenuya; musyenu ndamba yimosi kuna mulembu yi tsabatu kuna malu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Natenu mwana ngombi wa senga, muhondenu phi; tudyenu, twata mukinzi, <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>mukuma, mwana wama yandu kadikini wafwa, amana wuvutwakidi luzingu; kákadiki wátota, amana wusengumuki." Amana báyandika kuta mukinzi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Kinga, mwana wa tsomi, ku bilanga kákala. Buna kávutuka, amana wátula bela-bela yi nzu, wáyuka kizamba yi makinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Wátela mosi wa basadi mu kumuhyula mambu mana mákala luta. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Amana yandu wámuzimbwala: "Myaki waku wuvutuki, amana tata waku wumuhondisidi mwana ngombi wa mafuta, kikuma kamuvutwakidi yi lutu lwa ngolu." <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Kaasi mbuta wáfunga khabu; kázolaku kukota. Tata wandi wálubuka mu kumubokwadila. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Hanga wuvutudi kwena tata wandi: "Mvula za lawu kedi tsadi kikuma kya ngeyi hanga musadi, yisalaku kolama ku mitsiku myaku. Amana wasalaku pheka keti mwana phunda ndangu yita mukinzi yi banduku bama. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Kaasi tangwa kisi vutuka, mwana waku yandu wénda fwasa kuvwa kwaku yi bakhetu ba bandumba; kikuma kya yandi wumuhondisidi mwana ngombi wa mafuta!" <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Tata wámuzimbwala: "Ngeyi, mwana wama, wenina bilumbu byosu yi meni, amana kyosu kyenina kya meni, kyenina phi kya ngeyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Kaasi bulungiki twata bukheti mukinzi yi kusangwala, mukuma myaki waku yandu wumoni, kákadiki wafwa, amana wuvutwakidi luzingu; kákadiki watota amana wusengumuki!"»<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Kalema wa bikwaki yi wadimuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu kakala zimbula hika kwena balonguki: «Mutu mosi wa mvwama wákala yi kalema mosi; wuna bátungulula, wakala fwasa bima byandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Hanga mvwama wumutedi amana wumuzimbwadi: "Biki mbati yuka kuzonzila kikuma kya ngeyi? Tsongila phila yina wukasadilaka kisalu kyaku; mukuma wufwaniku hika kukala kalema ka meni." <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Kaphita wudizonzidi yandi meni: "Biki yihánga, kikuma pfumu wama mbotudikya kisalu kya kalema? Kusala bilanga? Yeku yi ngolu za kudima. Kulomba-lomba? Yiyúka tsoni." <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Nzayi buna yihánga, ndangu kwakala batu bana bangyámba, kwena bawu, tangwa bakhátula mu kisalu kyama kya kalema!" <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Hanga wutedisi kosu mutu wuna wákala yi pfuka ya pfumu wandi. Wuhyudi kwena watheti: "Thalu kwa wufwani kufuta kwena pfumu wama?" <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Yandi wávutula: "Mindungu khama mya masi." Amana Kalema wámuzimbwala: "Bonga mukanda waku wa pfuka; zakala tswasu, sonika: makumatanu." <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Kunima wáhyula kwena mukwawu wahika: "Amana ngeyi thalu kwa wufwani kufuta?" Yandi wávutula: "Tsaki khama za bule." Kalema wámuzimbwala: "Bonga mukanda waku wa pfuka sonika: makumi nana. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Amana pfumu wámuzatula kalema wuna wa bikwaki kikuma kásala mambu hanga mutu wadimuka mukuma batu ba tangwa dyadi, benina badimuka lawu mu mambu ma batu bana bafwanana bawu, kuluta bana benina mu mwini.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yesu wáyika: «Amana meni yiluzimbwadi: lakamenu kikhunda yi bimvwama bya mbi bya tsi yayi, ndangu tangwa byafwa, baluyamba mu bifulu bya luzingu lwakonda tsuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Wuna wena mwani mu bima bya khunda, kakála phi mwani mu bima bya mbuta. Amana wuna wukondi masonga mu bima bya khunda, keku phi yi masonga mu bima bya mbuta. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Yuka ni lwakálaku masonga mu kimvwama kya mwani kya tsi yayi, nati walúheka bimvwama bya kyedika? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Amana yukani lweku yi mwani ku kima kya mukwenu, nati walúheka kima kya benu-benu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Ka musadi mosi ku wufwani kakala muhika wa bapfumu bodi: holo kaménga mosi amana katónda mukwawu; kondilo kadínama yi mosi amana wumumengi mukwawu. Lufwaniku kusadila Nzambi yi mbongu.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutsiku yi kipfumu kya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mth 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Bafwadisi, bázoluka mbongu, bakala yuka mambu mana mosu amana báyandika kuseya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Benu lwisi dimonikisa batu ba bukheti, ku thwala batu, kaasi Nzambi wuzayi mbundu zenu. Mukuma, mambu mana menina ma mbuta ku mesu ma batu, mena nzanzi ku mesu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Yi kuna tangwa dya Yowani, mitsiku yi Bambikudi kwákala. Tuka buna, Kipfumu kya Nzambi básamunakya hanga Musamu wa Bukheti; amana kosu mutu kisi sya ngolu mu kukotamwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Kinga bweku phasi kikuma kya zilu yi tsi mu kuhyoka, kuluta kwa kisona kimosi kya mitsiku mu kubwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Wosu wuna wukatudi mukhetu wandi, amana kakwela wahika, mbongi kati. Amana wuna wukwedi mukhetu wuna bákatula ku longu kwena yakala dyandi, mbongi kati.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya Mvwama yi Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>«Hákala yi mutu mosi wa mvwama; wakala vwata miledi mya bukheti yi mya thalu kuluta; amana wakala ta kizamba yi kunata luzingu lwa khembu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Phutu mosi wákala lutu yi bitoni-bitoni, khumbu yandi Lasalu, kákala wanimba muna mwelu wa yandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Kakala zola kuyukuta bizotu bina byákala bwa mu tsi ya mesa ma mvwama. Bambwa bakala henda bitoni byandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Phutu wáfwa amana bámunata kwena banzyo bela-bela yi Bulahami. Mvwama phi wáfwa amana bámuzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Muna kalunga, kávumbula mesu, yi minyanga myandi, wámona kuna kyana Bulahami yi Lasalu hana kabeta ka yandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Hanga wubekitidi: "Tata Bulahami, ngyukila kyadi! Mutuma Lasalu kavundika tsongi ya mulembu wandi muna mamba, ndangu kandokisina ha lulaka mukuma mbati nyokuka mu mbawu yayi." <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Kaasi Bulahami wámuvutwala: "Mwana wama, bambuketi ni ngeyi wátambula mboti yaku mu luzingu lwaku, kaasi Lasalu, yandi, munyanga kávwa. Buthwena bwabu, kwaku, yandi kena walembwa, kaasi ngeyi wubati nyokuka. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Amana mu byana byosu, mbenga mosi ya mbuta basya ha kati dya betu yi benu, ndangu bana bazóla kuluta tuka kwaku yi kuna lwena benu, balendaku salabwa; amana ni balábukaku phi tuka kuna lwena benu yi kwena betu." <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Mvwama wázimbula: "Yikubokwadidi ngeyi tata mu kutuma Lasalu muna nzu ya tata wama; <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>mukuma yena yi baphangi batanu. Kenda banatina kimbangi kyandi ndangu bisaku, bawu phi, kuma kwaku kwena yi minyanga." <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Kaasi Bulahami kázimbula: "Bena yi Moyize yi Bambikudi: babayukila!" <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Mvwama wulanduludini: "Loni, tata Bulahami. Kaasi yuka ni mutu mosi wa ku bafwa kenda kwena bawu, babálumuna mbundu." <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Kaasi Bulahami wámuzimbwala: "Yukani bayukidiku Moyize yi Bambikudi, bakwíkilaku, keti mwena mutu wafútumuka ha kati dya bafwa."»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Disumu yi mulemvu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mth 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Bwalendaku salama ni kukalaku mambu mana misi hukumuna; kaasi kyadi kwena mutu wuna mabwidi! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Bulungi kwena yandi bamuzitikila, muna tsingu, kalunga tadi amana bamudibula muna yanga dya mbuta, ndangu kahukumuna nana mosi wa baleki baba. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Dikengenu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Yuka ni phangi waku kasumuki, musongila mbi yandi. Honi kabalula mbundu, mulolula. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Yukani kasumuki, kwena ngeyi, mbala tsambwadi muna kilumbu, amana ni mbala tsambwadi wisi vutuka kwena ngeyi, mu kuzimbula: "Yibálula mbundu", wamúlolula.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikumbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Bathumwa bázimbula kwena Pfumu: «Tuyika lukwikilu lwa lawu.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Pfumu wávutula: «Wadi lwakala yi lukwikilu hanga ngenza ya tidi, lukhani zonza kwena kalamba ka miti wawu: "Divusa, awenda dikuna muna yanga dya mbuta", amana wululemvukidi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisalu kya musadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>«Nati ha kati dya benu, yukani kakala yi musadi wisi bundula holo wisi hungula kibuka kya mikoku, tangwa kisi vutukisa ku bilanga, kamúzimbwala: "Awisa tswatsu wasikuka ha mesa"? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Kaasi kamúzimbwalaku bwabu: "Ndambila kudya kwa meni, vwata miledi mya kisalu kikuma kya kungidikila mesa, yi kuna yidya amana ndwi, kunima, ngeyi phi wafwana dya, wanwa phi"? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Yandi, keku yi mupfunu wa kumuvutwala matondu musadi wuna tangwa kamuhangidi bwosu kámulomba? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Phila mosi yi benu phi tangwa lwasála mosu mana kalúlomba, zimbulenu: "Betu, basadi kwetu thwenina; twásala lwesi mana twáfwana kusala."»<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki bakwa bwasi kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Bwosu kakala kwenda ku Yelusalemi, kakala hyokila hana kati dya Samadiya yi Ngadidi. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Amana mu kukota kwandi mu hata dimosi, bakwa bwasi kumi bisa mutundakana. Bátelama kuna kyana, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>báthuta ndinga amana bázimbula: «Yesu, Mulongi, tuyukila kyadi!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Amana tangwa kábamona, wábazimbwala: «Ndenu lwenda disongila kwena banganga Nzambi.» Buna bakala kwenda kwakuna, básema.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Mosi wa bawu, buna kádimona ni wusemi, wisa vutukisa, mu kuzatula Nzambi mu ndinga ya ngolu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Wábwa mbunzu mu mafu muna bitambi bya Yesu amana wámuvutwala matondu. Mwisi Samadiya kákala.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Amana Yesu wáhyula: «Ka boosu ku bawu kumi basemi? Amana vwa dyahika, ku biki dyenina? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Kaka munzenza meni yandu lwesi wudimonikisi mu kwisa vutuka kuhana khembu kwena Nzambi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Kunima, wámuzimbwala: «Telama, ndawenda. Lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukwisa kwa kipfumu kya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23">Mth 24:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24:37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Bamuhyudi kwena Bafwadisi ndangu bazaya ho mu khi tangwa kyakwísa Kipfumu kya Nzambi. Yandi wábavutwala: «Kipfumu kya Nzambi kisiku kwisa mu phila yina bafwani bamoninakya. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Bazímbulaku ni "Talenu, haka kyenina!" Holo "Kuna kyenina!" Mukuma Kipfumu kya Nzambi, hana kati dya benu kyenina.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Amana wázimbula hika kwena balonguki: «Bilumbu byakwísa bina lwasánda ndangu lwamóna keti kimosi kya bilumbu bya Mwana wa mutu, kaasi lwamónakyoku. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Balúzimbwala: "Kuna kenina!" Holo, "Kwaku kenina!" Kaasi lwendakwoku, lutsyakulakwoku. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Mukuma, bwosu wisi kenya munyenya, tselu yi tselu ya zilu, yibwana buna kakála Mwana wa mutu mu kilumbu kyandi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Kaasi buluti theti, kanyokwama lawu; amana bamulosila kwena mbandu yayi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Mana máluta mu bilumbu bya Nowa; phila mosi malúta mu bilumbu bya Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Batu bakala dya, bakala nwa, bayakala yi bakhetu bakala kwela yi ku dikwela tii yi kuna kakótila Nowa mu nzasa: hanga kithombu kisi zaluka, kibatotisi boosu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Bwana, bwabuna bwákala phi hanga mu bilumbu bya Loti: batu bakala dya, bakala nwa, bakala sumba, bakala sumbisa, bakala kuna amana bakala tunga phi; <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>kaasi kilumbu kina kalubuka Loti mu Sotomu, mvula mosi wanoka wa mbawu yi bupfundu bwakala lema ku zilu, amana wábatotisa boosu. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Phila mosi malúta kilumbu kina kakwisa sengumuka Mwana wa mutu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>«Muna kilumbu kina, wuna wakála ku nzila hana mudilu, wakála yi bima byandi mu nzu, katulukaku kikuma kya kubongabya; amana wuna wakála phi ku bilanga, kavutukaku mu manima. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Bambukenu mukhetu wa Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Wuna wásanda kusweka luzingu lwandi, katótisalwa, kaasi wuna watótisalwa, kahúlulalwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>"Yiluzimbwadibwa ni, muna phipha meni yina, ha kati dya batu bodi bakála ha thangi yimosi, mosi bamútambula amana mukwawu kasála. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Mu kati dya bakhetu bodi bakwata toka mu kindundu, mosi bamúnata, mukwawu kasála. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Bayakala bodi bakála mu kilanga kimosi, mosi bamúnata, mukwawu kasála.» <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Balonguki bámuzimbwala: «Ku biki, Pfumu?» Amana yandi wávutula: «Kuna kwakála mvumbi, yi kwakuna phi bakútakanina bangandwanganga.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mufwidi yi zusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesu kakala batila kingana kyaki mu kusongila ni bulungi, kulombila bilumbu byosu amana konda kulembwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Kázimbula bwabu: «Kwákala, ku mbanza mosi, yi zusi mosi, wákalaku banga Nzambi amana kakala lewula mutu woosu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mwákala phi, muna mbanza meni yana, yi mukhetu mosi wa mufwidi wuna wakala kwisa mu kumuzimbwala: "Nzengila mukanu wawu, kikuma baphangi mbi." <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Tuka thama, zusi kázolaku; kaasi kunima, wádizimbwala: "Ketibwe yisiku banga Nzambi amana yisi lewula batu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>kaasi kikuma mufwidi yandu kabati ngyangisa, yimúzengila mukanu ndangu kisaku ngyata mutwa."» <verse eid="LUK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Pfumu wáyika: «Yukenu buna kazimbudi zusi wa mbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Amana Nzambi, kakonda zengila, batu bandi kásola, mukanu, tangwa babati mutela phipha yi mwini? Kabáhingidisa? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Yiluzimbwadibwa, kabázengila mukanu yi tswatsu. Kaasi tangwa kakwísa Mwana wa mutu, lukwikilu kakwisa wana ha tsi?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya Mufwadisi yi kalaki ka phaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yesu wáta hika kingana kyaki, kikuma kya batu bahika bisi dibanzila ni basungama kaasi bisi lewula bakwawu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Bayakala bodi bakala kwenda ku nzu ya Nzambi mu kulombila; mosi kákala mufwadisi, mukwawu, kalaki ka phaku. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Mufwadisi wátelama, wálombila bwabu yandi meni: "Ah! Nzambi, yikuvutwadi matondu kikuma yeku hanga bayakala bahika, bena befi yi batu bakonda sungama, bita-mbongi; holo hanga kalaki ka phaku yandi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Yisi zila kudya, mbala zodi muna phosa, yisi futa kimosi kya kumi kya bima byama byosu." <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Kalaki ka phaku, yandi, kákala watelama kuna kyana; kálendaku kuvumbula mesu ku zilu, kaasi kákala bunda hana thulu yi kuzonzaka: "Ah! Nzambi, ngyukila kyadi, musumuki yenina." <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Kyedika yiluzimbwadibwa, yandu-yandu wákulumuka hika ku nzu yandi, mu ndonga yi Nzambi; kaasi ka wuna ku mukwawu. Mukuma wuna wadítombula, kakúlumuka; kaasi wuna wadíkulumuna, katómbuka.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi bana bakhunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mth 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Batu bakala nata kwena Yesu keti bana bakhunda ba lubutu, ndangu kabasimba yi koku. Balonguki, mu kumona bwabuna, báyandika kubakaya. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Kaasi Yesu wáhana muswa ni bamunatina bawu amana wázimbula: «Yambulenu bana bisa kwena meni. Lubakandisaku, mukuma Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyenina kikuma kya bana bena hanga bawu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: wuna wakonda yamba Kipfumu kya Nzambi hanga mwana wa khunda, kakótamwoku, swa!»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi mvwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mth 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Pfumu mosi wáhyula kwena Yesu: «Mulongi wa bukheti, biki pfwani yihanga mu kubonga luzingu lwakonda tsuka?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki wuthedidi wa bukheti? Heku mutu wenina wa bukheti ho ka Nzambi lwesi ku. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Wuzayi mitsiku: "Taku mbongi, hondaku, yibaku; taku kimbangi kya luvunu, zitisa tata waku yi ngudi waku.» <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Mutu wuna wávutula: «Yisi lemvukilamya myana myosu tukidila kileki kyama.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu buna kámuyuka bwabuna, wázimbula: «Kima kimosi hika kikukondi; tekisa byosu bina wena byawu, kabisabya kwena baphutu amana watámbula kimvwama mu mazilu. Kunima, nzawisa ndanda.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Kaasi buna káyuka bwabuna, wekina mu kiwayi kya lawu, mukuma mvwama wambuta kákala. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu buna kámumona bwabuna mu kiwayi, wázimbula: «Phasi bwena kwena bana benina yi kimvwama mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Mukuma bweku phasi kwena Kamela mu kulobuka ha hundu dya ndongu, kuluta mvwama mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Bana bakala muyuka bázimbula: «Amana nati wufwani kahuluka?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu wávutula: «Mambu mana maléndakanaku kwena batu, maléndakana kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Phetelu wázimbula: «Talandi, betu twásisa bima byákala bya betu, mu kukulanda ngeyi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadibwa, heku mutu wásisa, kikuma kya Kipfumu kya Nzambi, nzu yi mukhetu yi baphangi, yi tata yi ngudi wandi, holo bana, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>kakonda tambula, bya lawu kuluta mu tangwa dyadi yi muna tsi yina yisi kwisa, luzingu lwakonda tsuka.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu samuni mu mbala ya tatu lufwa lwandi yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mth 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu wábonga bawu Kumi yi bodi amana wábazimbwala bwabu «Tubati tombuka ku Yelusalemi. Mambu moosu mana másonama mu nzila ya bambikudi kikuma kya Mwana wa mutu, malúngila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Mukuma bamúlambula ku moku ma baphani, bamúseya, bamútukwana, bamúlokwala metya. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Bamúzyatula, kunima bamúhonda. Amana kilumbu kya tatu, kafútumuka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Kaasi bawu bábakisaku keti kima mu moosu mana; thendula ya ndinga yina yabákadila yakufidinga, bázayaku keti biki bwazola kuzonza.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki phofu mosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mth 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Bwosu kakala phusana bela-bela yi Yediko, phofu mosi kakala wasikuka kuna kabeta ka nzila yi kulombaka. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Wáyuka mulumba-lumba wa batu wákala hyoka amana wáhyula keti biki byabina. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Bámuvutwala: «Yesu mwisi Nazaleti wubati luta.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Kahanga wukalungi: «Yesu, Mwana Tavidi, ngyukila kyadi!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Bana bákala ku thwala, báyandika kumukaya ndangu kadibata. Kaasi wákalunga hika ngolu: «Mwana wa Tavidi ngyukila kyadi!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu wátelama, amana wásenda ni bamunatina yandi. Tangwa kábwesuka, Yesu wámuhyula: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Biki wuzodi yihanga kikuma kya ngeyi?» Yandi wávutula: «Pfumu, nzodi yimona hika.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Hanga Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Mona hika. Lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, wáyandika kumona amana wámulanda mu kuzatula Nzambi. Batu boosu, mu kumona bwabuna, báyandika mu kukumisa Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Zakhayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu wákota mu Yediko amana wáhyokila muna mbanza. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Kwákala kwakuna yi mutu mosi, khumbu yandi Zakhayi; wákala pfumu wa bakalaki ka phaku, mvwama phi kákala. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Kakala sanda mu kumona keti nati kákala Yesu, kaasi kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu, kálendaku kumumona, mukuma wakhufi kákala. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Hanga wénda thinu kuna thwala amana wázanza muna miti mosi ndangu kamumona, kikuma mwamuna kafwana kulutila. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Amana buna kátula Yesu homa meni yayina, wáthuta mesu ku zilu amana wámuzimbwala: «Zakhayi, tuluka tswatsu, bulungi, yikala lelu ku nzu yaku.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakhayi wátuluka tswasu mu kumuyamba yi kyesi kyosu. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Amana mu kumona bwabuna, boosu bányengalakana: «Wendi kala ku nzu ya musumuki.» <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Kaasi Zakhayi, wamutendendi, wuzimbudi kwena Pfumu: «Pfumu, yihána kwena batsukami kati-kati dya kuvwa kwama, amana yukani yihuna mu kulutula thalu ya kosu kima kina kwena mutu, yimúvutwala mbala ya.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu kámuzimbwala: «Lelu luhulusu lwisi kikuma kya nzu yayi, mukuma yandi phi kenina mwana mosi wa Bulahami. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Mukuma, Mwana wa mutu kisa sanda yi kuhulula kina kyátota.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya makuta ma wolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mth 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Bwosu bakala yuka bima bina, Yesu wáyika hika kingana kimosi kikuma bela-bela yi Yelusalemi kákala, amana bakala banza ni Kipfumu kya Nzambi fwani kyamonika muna tangwa meni dina. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Hanga wuzimbudi bwabu: «Mutu mosi wa kikanda kya lukumu wénda ku tsi ya kyana, mu kumuyadika kipfumu kya hata dyandi; ku nima dya kuvutuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Amana kahanga wutedi kumi dya basadi bandi, wubaheki mafwalanga kumi ma wolu. Amana wábazimbwala: "Sadilenuzoku bikhita tii yi kuna yikwisa vutwakila." <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Kaasi bakwa mulambu wandi bakala mumenga, amana bátuma kibuka kimosi kya bambambala ku manima ma yandi, ndangu benda zimbula kuna mbanza yina kenda: "Betu tuzodiku: mutu yandu katuyala." <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>"Buna kávutuka, kunima dya kumuyadika kipfumu, hanga wutedisi basadi bana káheka makuta, ndangu kazaya keti bweti básadilama. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Watheti wísa amana wázimbula: "Pfumu, fwalanga dyaku dya wolu dilumbudi makwawu kumi." <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Pfumu wámuzimbwala: "Bwa bukheti, wenina musadi mosi wa bukheti kikuma wuhwidi mwani mu mambu ma khunda; watámbula kipfumu ha thandu ya mbanza kumi." <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Wazodi wísa amana wázimbula: "Pfumu, fwalanga dyaku dya wolu dilumbudi matanu makwawu." <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Pfumu wámuvutwala: "Ngeyi, phila mosi, wakála pfumu wa mbanza tanu." <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Wahika wísa, amana wázimbula: "Pfumu, tala di, fwalanga dyaku dya wolu dina yízindika ha kitemba. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Mukuma ngeyi mbangiki, kikuma ngeyi wena mutu wa mathata. Wisi bonga bima bina wusikudiku amana wisi hela bina wukuniku." <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Pfumu wámuzimbwala: "Muna ndinga zaku meni zina yi mwana yikúfundisila, musadi wa mbi! Wázaya ni meni mukwa mathata. Yisi bonga bima bina tsikudiku; yisi hela phi bina khuniku. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Amana kikuma kya biki wakonda sila mbongu zama mu nzu yina bisi vudisila mbongu? Mu kuvutuka kwama yikakwenda bongaza yi muluta." <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Kunima wázimbula kwena batu bana bákala hana: "Mubotulenudyoku fwalanga dya wolu amana hekenudya kwena wuna wena yi mafwalanga kumi." <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Bámuzimbwala: "Pfumu, yandi mafwalanga ma wolu kumi kenina mawu kedi!" <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Yandi wávutula: "Yiluzimbwadibwa: bayíka kwena wuna wena yi bima; kaasi wuna kondi kima, bamúbwotula keti kina kena kyawu. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Kaasi kwena bambeni bama, bana bazodikiku ni yibayala, banatenu kwaku amana bazengenu tsingu ha mesu mama."»<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukoti mu Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mth 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ywn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Kunima dya kuzimbula bwabuna, Yesu wénda ku thwala bawu amana wátombuka ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Tangwa kátula bela-bela yi mahata mama: Betifasi yi Betaniya, bela-bela yi mongu wa Olive, wátuma bodi ba balonguki bandi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>wubazimbwadi: «Alwenda kuna hata dina dyenina kuna sambwa; ha lwakóta, lwamóna mwana wa ane mosi wuna bisi zanza batu, wakuzitikila; wuna bakonda zanza kedi keti mbala mosi kwena mutu. Mukutumunenu amana munatenu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Yukani mutu kaluhyula: "kikuma kya biki lubati mukutwamina?", lwamúzimbwala bwabu: "Pfumu mupfunu kamuvi."»<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Bana kátuma benda amana báwana mambu bwosu kábazimbwala. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Tangwa bakala kutumuna mwana ane<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna bikalulu bya bikanda byahika, mbisi wuna ane bakala musadila hanga mbisi wuna wisi tikula mazitu. Kenina wakhunda kuluta baphunda bana bakodini. Bisi muzayila muna matu mandi ma kaleyi. Ane kenina kidimbu kya kudikulumuna kwa Masiya.</char></note>, bakwa yandi bábazimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki lubati kutwamina mwana wa ane?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bávutula: «Pfumu mupfunu kamuvi.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Amana bámunata mwana wa ane kwena Yesu, kunima bátimbula miledi mya bawu hana kunda dya mwana wa ane, amana bámuzanzisa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Tangwa kakala kwenda, batu bakala yala mizaka mya bawu muna nzila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Amana kakala bwesuka ku khulumuka ya mongu wa ba Olive tangwa bakala sangwala kibuka kya balonguki, bakala zatula Nzambi mu ndinga ya ngolu, kikuma kya biphadi byosu bina bámona. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Bakala zimbula: «Kasakumuka wuna wisi kwisila mu khumbu ya Pfumu! Ngemba mu zilu yi khembu muna bisoka!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Amana ndambu ya Bafwadisi, muna mulumba-lumba wa batu, bámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, bakaya balonguki baku.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yandi wábavutwala: «Yiluzimbwadibwa, yukani bawu badibata, matadi makálunga!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudidi kikuma kya Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Amana mu kubwesuka, Yesu wámona mbanza amana wádila kikuma kya yawu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>mu kuzimbula: «Wadi ngeyi phi wázaya, mu kilumbu kyaki, abweti kutambula ngemba! Kaasi buthwena moosu makusweka mena ku mesu maku. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Mukuma bilumbu byakwísa, kwena ngeyi, bina bakúzyeta buna bufwani kwena bambeni baku amana bakúzinga yi kukufitikisa muma mwosu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Bakúbula, ngeyi yi bana baku mu kati dya ngeyi, amana basísaku mu kati dya ngeyi keti tadi ha thandu ya tadi, kikuma wázayidilaku tangwa dina kisi kutala Nzambi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu muna nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mth 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ywn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Amana buna kákota mu nzu ya Nzambi, wáyandika kukula batu bana bakala tekisa bima. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Mu kubazimbwala: «Básonika bwabu: "Nzu yama, yakála nzu yimosi ya bisambu." Kaasi benu, lukitudiya saka dya bandwandwa.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yesu kakala longa bilumbu byosu muna nzu ya Nzambi. Amana bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku yi bapfumu ba bikanda bakala sanda phila ya kumuhondila. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Kaasi bázayaku ketibwe bahanga, mukuma batu boosu bákangama yi yandi mu kumuyuka.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Nati wumuheki Yesu kipfumu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mth 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Mosi kya bilumbu meni byabina, bwosu kakala longa batu mu nzu ya Nzambi yi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta bátula hakana <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>amana bámuzimbwala: «Tuzimbwala, mu hamu dya nati wubati sadila bwana; nati kena wuna kuheki hamu meni wuna?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Meni phi, yiluyufula kyufu kimosi. Nzimbwalenu: <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Mbotika ya Yowani, ku zilu yátuka ho kwena batu?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Kaasi bawu báyandika kudiwinina bawu yi bawu bazimbudi: «Yuka twavutula ni "Ya ku zilu", kazimbula bwabu: "Biki lwakonda mukwikidila?" <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Yuka phi twazimbula: "Ya batu", batu boosu batuhonda ku matadi, mukuma bwa kyedika ni Yowani mbikudi kákala.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Hanga bavutudi: «Tuzayiku keti nati wámutuma.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Meni phi yilúzimbwlaku keti mu hamu dya nati yisi sadila bwabuna.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya basadi bambi ba kilanga kya vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mth 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Kunima, Yesu wáyandika kuta kingana kyaki kwena batu: «Yakala mosi wákuna kilanga kya vinu, wáluwisakya kwena batu, amana yandi wénda kuma kwa kyana, wázingidila kwakuna. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Tangwa ha dyalungila, wátuma musadi mosi kwena batu bana bakala tala kilanga kya vinu, ndangu bawu bahitika ndambu yandi ya vinu. Kaasi batu bana bakala tala kilanga bámubeta musadi wuna amana bámuvutula moku ma khatu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Wátuma hika musadi mukwawu, kaasi bámubeta, bámutukwana, kunima bámukukwasa moku ma khatu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Wátuma hika musadi wa tatu; yana phi bámulweka amana bámukukwasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Hanga mukwa kilanga kya vinu wuzimbudi: "Bweti yihanga? Yitúma mwana wama wazolwa; ngatu bamúzitisa." <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Kaasi tangwa bámumona, batu babana bákala futila mu kilanga, bádizonzila: "Tala yandu swana! Tumuhondenu ndangu kuvwa kwakituka kwa betu." <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Hanga bamulosi ku manima ma kilanga kya vinu amana bámuhonda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Amana bweti kakwisa bahanga mukwa kilanga kya vinu? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Kakwísa, hanga bahondi batu bana bisi futila mu kilanga kya vinu amana kilanga kahánakya kwena batu bahika.» Buna báyuka ndinga zazina, batu bázimbula: «Mambu mama fwaniku masalama!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Kaasi Yesu wábatala, wubazimbwadi: «Biki disongidila dya ndinga yayi básonika»:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">"Tadi dina bálosa batungi ba nzu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">dikituki tadi dya mupfundila wa nzu."<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>«Wosu wuna wabwa hana tadi medina, dyamana mutolula; amana wuna dyabwíla tadi dina, dyamúfukumuna.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaku ya pfumu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mth 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Muna tangwa medina, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi, bakala sanda ni bamukwata Yesu, kaasi báyuka bweya bwa batu. Bábakula ni bawu kátila kingana kina. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Báyandika kumukengidila. Bátuma batu bana bakala disongila hanga batu basungama. Batu bana bazodi bamuleya Yesu mu kyufu kimosi, ndangu bamulambula kwena bayadi ba kinzunga. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Bámuhyula: «Mulongi, tuzayi ni wisi zonza, wisi longa phi yi singu. Wisiku hambula mbunzu, kaasi wisi songila mu kyedika nzila ya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tufwani kufuta phaku ya Khayisala ho loni?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Amana bwosu kábakula mabanza ma bawu ma mbi, wábavutwala: <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Tsongilenu fwalanga dimosi. Mbunzu yi khumbu yayi básonika haka, bya nati?» Bawu bávutula: «Bya Khayisala.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Amana Yesu wábazimbwala: «Ho yi bwabuna, hanenu kwena Khayisala bina byena bya yandi amana kwena Nzambi bina byena bya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Balendaku kumukwata keti mu ndinga yandi mosi ku thwala batu. Kaasi mvutu yandi yábayitwakisa amana bádibata.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyufu kikuma kya lufutumuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mth 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Ndambu ya Basadise bana bisi kwikila ni kweku lufutumuku, hanga bisi muhyula: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>Bazonzi: «Mulongi, Moyize kátuheka mutsiku wawu básonika: "Yukani yakala mosi, wena yi myaki wandi honi kafwa amana kasisa mukhetu kaasi konda kubuta mwana yi yandi, bulungi kakwela mufwidi wuna ndangu kabuta bana ba thayi wandi." <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Kinga, kwákala yi baphangi ba bayakala tsambwadi. Watheti wákwela mukhetu, wáfwa konda mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wazodi, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>kunima, wuna wa tatu wákwela mukhetu; bwásalama phila mosi kwena bawu tsambwadi, báfwa konda kusisa bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Kunima, mukhetu phi wáfwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Kilumbu kya lufutumuku, mukhetu wuna wa nati kakála? Mukuma boosu tsambwadi, bámukwela hanga mukhetu wa bawu!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Mu bulunda bwabu, bakhetu yi bayakala bisi dikwela; <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>kaasi bana bázengila ni bafwana kukota mu bulunda buna yi ku lufutumuku lwa bafwa, bawu, badíkwelaku hika. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Bafwánaku hika mu kufwa, kikuma bafwanani yi banzyo amana bekina bana ba Nzambi, hanga bana ba lufutumuku. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Bafwa bafútumuka, bwosu katekila zimbula Moyize kikuma kya zanga dya mbawu dyákala mu miti, tangwa kámutela Pfumu: "Nzambi wa Bulahami, Nzambi wa Kizaki yi Nzambi wa Yakobi." <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Kinga keku Nzambi wa batu bafwa, kaasi wa batu bana bena mu luzingu, mukuma boosu bisi zinga kikuma kya yandi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku bahika bávutula: «Mulongi, mboti wuzonzi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Amana bámekaku hika kumuhyula keti kyufu kimosi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya yi Tavidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mth 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Abweti bafwani kuzimbula ni Kidisitu kenina mwana wa Tavidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Mukuma yandi meni Tavidi, bwabu kásonika muna mukanda wa mikunga»:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">"Pfumu kázimbula kwena Pfumu wama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">"Sikuka ku kitata kyama;<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>Yikuna yikítwala bambeni baku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">kidyatilu kyaku."<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>«Amana Tavidi kisi mutela ni "Pfumu"; amana abweti kafwani kukala hika mwana wandi?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulwengisa kikuma kya balongi ba mitsiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mth 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Buna bakala muyuka batu boosu, Yesu wázimbula kwena Balonguki bandi: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Kebenu yi balongi ba mitsiku. Bazodi kukangala yi malophu ma kaleyi. Bisi zola ni batu babahekaka mboti mu mazandu. Bisi zola kuzakala ha bifulu bya theti mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, bazodi phi bifulu bya lukumu mu mafeti. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Bisi botula bima mu nzu za bafwidi, bisi samba malombilu ma kaleyi kikuma kya kudimonikisa. Bawu batámbula pfundusu yina yalúta kitesu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Kabu dya mufwidi mosi wa phutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu wáthuta mesu; wumoni bamvwama bana bakala sya kuvwa kwa bawu mu mukunzu wa nzu ya Nzambi, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>wumoni phi mufwidi mosi wa phutu, wásyamwa ndisu zodi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Amana wuzimbudi: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa: mufwidi yandu wa phutu kasini kuluta boosu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Mukuma, boosu bana báhani muna kulutuka kwa kuvwa kwa bawu; kaasi yandi, kahani muna kiphutu kyandi, kyosu kina kafwaniki mu kuzingila.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni kubwa kwa nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mth 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Bwosu bakala zonzila ndambu ya batu kikuma kya nzu ya Nzambi yi buna bátungilaya mu matadi ma kitoku yi makabu mana bánenginaya. Hanga Yesu wuzimbudi: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Bilumbu byakwísa, mu byosu byabi lubati mona, kwasálaku keti tadi ha thandu ya dikwawu, dina bakonda wulumuna.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phasi yi minyanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mth 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Amana bámuhyula: «Mulongi, khi tangwa malúta mambu mana? Khi kidimbu kyatékidila mu kusongila mambu meni mana?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yandi wávutula: «Kebenu, luhunakanaku. Mukuma balawu bakwísa mu khumbu ya meni, bazónza: "Meni yenina Kidisitu!" bathétika hika: "Tangwa dibwesuki!" Kaasi lubalandaku. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Tangwa lwayúka: kuzonzila mvita yi mvwalangani, lubangaku; mukuma bulungi mambu mana maluta theti, kaasi tsuka yeku kikuma kya tangwa dyadi.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Yesu kakala zimbula hika: «Kanda dimosi dyanwánisa kanda dikwawu amana kipfumu yi kipfumu kikwawu; <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>kwakála yi kunikana kwa lawu kwa mafu amana mu binzunga bya lawu, nzala yi kiphuphu byakóta. Mambu ma lawu ma bweya makála yi bidimbu bya mbuta byatúka ku zilu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Kaasi ku thwala bina byosu, balúkwata, balúnyokuna, balúlambula mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, amana balúsya mu boloku; balúnata ku thwala bakyamvu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hana babati zonzila "bathotila" mu mikanda mya kisina, yi hakana tubati zonzila betu "bakyamvu" kikuma ndinga ya betu bayalayoku kwena bathotila. Tala muna Mth 10:17-22.</char></note> ba tsi yi bapfumu ba binzunga kikuma kya khumbu ya meni. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Yakála nzila kikuma kya benu ndangu lwata kimbangi kya khumbu ya meni. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Zayenu mboti ni lufwaniku kudiyangisa kikuma kya phila yina lwakwenda sambila. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Mukuma meni-meni, yilúheka ndinga mosi yi mudimu wumosi wuna balendaku kunanama kwena bambeni benu keti kubalumuna. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Balúlambula kwena batata benu yi bangudi benu, baphangi benu, biwutu byenu yi banduku benu phi; amana balawu babáhondisa ha kati kya benu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Balúmenga kwena batu boosu kikuma kya khumbu ya meni. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Kaasi keti lusuki lumosi lwa mutwa wenu lwatótaku. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Muna kikwamina kyenu, lwatámbula luzingu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzonzidi kuzangana kwa Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mth 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Tangwa lwamóna basuta bazingidya Yelusalemi, zayenu ni kuzangana kwandi kubwesuki. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Amana bana bakála ku Yuteya, batína mu malondi; bana bakála ha kati dya mbanza, balúbuka; amana bana bakála mu bilanga, bakotaku mu mbanza. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Mukuma byakála bilumbu bya ndola, ndangu malungila moosu mana menina ma kusonika. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Khi kyadi kwena bakhetu bana bakála ku mavumu, yi bana bakala yemika muna bilumbu meni byabina! Phasi lawu zakála mu tsi, khabu zamónika kwena batu ba tsi meni yana. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Babwa ku mbedi ya phoku, babánata hanga bakwa boloku mu tsi zoosu, amana Yelusalemi badyátadya kwena tsi zoosu za baphani, yi kuna byamánisina bilumbu bina bábaheka.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukwisa kwa Mwana mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mth 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Bikhwidimba byamónika kuna tangwa yi kuna ngondi yi muna bambweteti. Ha tsi, batu bawókumuka yi tsula ya lawu kikuma kya malokosi ma pfunzi ya yanga dya mbuta yi kimbongila. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Batu balawu badímina ku bweya bwa mambu mana mabwíla tsi, mukuma ngolu za mazilu, zaníkana lawu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Amana bamóna Mwana wa mutu kabati kwisa hana thandu ya dituti, yi ngolu za lawu yi khembu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Tangwa mayandiki kusalama mambu mana, vumbukenu, thutenu mutwa kuna zilu, kikuma luhulusu lwenu lubwesukini.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya miti mosi bisi tela wufiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mth 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kunima, Yesu wábatila kingana kyaki: «Talenu mufiki yi miti myosu: <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Buna misi yandika kulubula khaya, muna kutala kwa khatu, lwisi bakula ni tsungi ya bukheti yibwesuki. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Phila mosi yi benu phi, tangwa lwamóna mambu mana kuluta, zayenu ni Kipfumu kya Nzambi kibwesuki. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadibwa: mbandu ya batu baba yahítaku kedi yi kuna masálamina mana moosu. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Zilu yi tsi byátota, kaasi ndinga zama zalendaku tota.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupfunu wa kukala kosu tangwa watemuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«Dikebisenu! Mbundu yenu yikalaku mu tsumbi ya mikinzi yi kuzela kwa malafu, yi mu kikuma kya luzingu, ndangu kilumbu kina kiluwanaku mu kithulumukina, <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>hanga wanda; mukuma kyakwísa hana thandu ya boosu bana bisi zinga ha tsi yosu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Kalenu batemuna amana lombilakenu kosu tangwa, ndangu lwakala yi ngolu za kutinina mambu moosu mana malúta, lwalenda telama phi ku thwala Mwana wa mutu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Amana kosu kilumbu, mu mwini, Yesu kakala longa muna nzu ya Nzambi, amana kakala lubuka ndangu kenda nimba, mu phipha, ku mongu wuna bisi tela ni wa ba Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Amana muna suka batu boosu bakala kwisa kwena yandi, muna nzu ya Nzambi, ndangu bamuyuka.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Bamukasidi fwongu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mth 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ywn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Mukinzi wa mapha makonda muvimbu, wuna bisi tela ni Phaki, hanga wákuma belabela. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku beka sanda phila ndangu bamuhondisa, mukuma bweya bwa batu bákala bwawu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yutasi wuyilami mu kumulambula Yesu kwena bapfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mth 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Hanga Satana wukoti mwena Yutasi wuna bakala tela ni Sikadyoti, wákala phi ha kati dya bawu Kumi yi bodi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Hanga yandi, wendi yukana yi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bapfumu ba batsinzidi ba nzu ya Nzambi mu phila yina káfwana kubalambwala yandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Básangwala lawu, báyukana phi ni bamuheka mbongu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yutasi wátambwasa, wáyandika phi kusanda tangwa dya bukheti ndangu kabalambwala yandi, mu kitsweki, konda bazayabwa kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yidikisi madya ma Phaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mth 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ywn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Kilumbu kya mukinzi wa mapha makonda muvimbu, wuna bafwana kutambika kimenga kya Phaki, wálungila. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Hanga Yesu wutumi Phetelu yi Yowani, wubazimbwadi: «Alwenda tuyidikila Phaki ndangu twenda dyaya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Ku biki wuzodi thwenda yidikilaya?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yandi wubavutwadi: «Tangwa lwakóta mu mbanza, mutu mosi lwatúndakana yi kalondu kandi ka mamba; mulandenu yi muna nzu muna kakóta, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>amana lwazímbula kwena mukwa nzu: "Mulongi kabati kuhyula ni khi mwanza pfwani yidila Phaki, meni yi balonguki bama?" <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Kalúsongila mwanza wumosi wena wa mbuta kuna zilu, wena wakuyidika kedi. Yi mwamuna lwayídikila mambu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Hanga bendi, bawani phi mambu bwosu kábazimbwala, bayidika phi mukinzi wa Phaki.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Madya ma Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mth 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Amana tangwa ha dyalungila, Yesu kakala kuna mesa, amana bathumwa bákala kumosi yi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Wubazimbwadi: «Yi mbundu yama yosu thondikini kudya mukinzi wawu wa Phaki kumosi yi benu, ku thwala kunyokuka, <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>mukuma yiluzimbwadibwa ni yidya woku hika tii yi kuna bwalúngila mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Hanga wubongi mbungu yimosi, kunima kumuvutwala Nzambi matondu wuzimbudi hika: «Bongenu yayi, kabulenuyoku muna kati dya benu; <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>mukuma, yiluzimbwadibwa: tukila lelu, yinwáku hika malafu ma vinu, tii yikuna kyakwísila Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Kunima, wubongi dipha; kunima kuvutula matondu, wubukunidya amana wubahekidya mu kuzimbula: «Lwena lutu lwama, luna lulambuki kikuma kya benu. Salakenu bwabuna mu kumbambukaka meni.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Wáhanga bwabuna phi kima kya mbungu, kunima dya kudya, wuzimbudi: «Mbungu yayi yena kuyukana kwa pha kwa Nzambi, mu nzila menga ma meni, mana matyakani kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Kaasi talenu: wuna wuzodi kathekisa haha kena, ha mesa yi meni! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Mukuma, Mwana wa mutu kabati kwenda, bwosu buna bwáyilama; kaasi kyadi kwena mutu wuna wamúlambula!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Amana báyandika kudihyula bawu yi bawu keti nati wufwani kasala dyambu dya buna.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nati wenina mbuta?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Hanga balonguki bayandiki kutendana hana kati dya bawu ndangu bazaya keti nati wufwani batela mbuta. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Bakyamvu ba tsi za baphani bisi bayala mu kingolu-ngolu amana batu bana bena phi yi kiyeka kya kudyatisa tsi bisi zola: batu bahika babatelaka basadi basadi ba mamboti. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Kaasi benu, kabunaku. Wuna wena mbuta ha kati dya benu, kakala hanga muleki wa benu, amana wuna wisi yidika ndonga kakala hanga wuna wubati sadila. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Amana, nati wena mbuta? Wuna wena ha mesa ho wuna wubati musadila? Ka wuna ku wena ha mesa? Amana meni yena ha kati dya benu hanga wuna wisi sadila! <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Benu lwena batu bana bakwamini yi meni, mu bimeka byama; <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>amana meni yiluheki Kipfumu kya Nzambi, bwosu káhanakya tata kwena meni, <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>ndangu lwadya, lwanwa phi ha mesa mama muna Kipfumu kyama, ndangu lwazakala mu biti bya kipfumu mu kusambisa bikanda kumi yi byodi bya Kiseledi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzimbudi ni Phetelu kamutuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mth 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ywn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>«Simoni, Simoni! Tala: Satana wululombidi nzila mu kuluhenga bwosu bisi hengula losu yi tswala. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Kaasi meni ndombidiki kikuma kya ngeyi, ndangu lukwikilu lwaku lumanisaku. Amana ngeyi, tangwa wavútukisa, basyamisa baphangi baku.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Pfumu, yena wayilama mu kukwenda kumosi yi ngeyi yi mu boloku, yi ku lufwa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Yikuzimbwadibwa, Phetelu, khoku kakókulaku kedi, lelu, ngeyi wathúna mbala tatu ni wunzayiku.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbongu, waba yi mbedi ya phoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Tangwa yílutuma konda makuta keti waba, keti tsabatu, Kima kyahika kyálukonda?» Bawu bavutudi: «loni, ka kima ku.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Hanga yandi wubazimbwadi: «Kaasi buthwena, wuna wena yi makuta, kanata, wuna wena phi yi waba, kanata, phila mosi yi wuna wukondi mbedi ya phoku, katekisa muzaka wandi ndangu kasumba mbedi ya phoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Mukuma yiluzimbwadibwa ni bulungi ni buna básonika, bwalungila mwena meni: "bamukotisi mu ndonga ya bandwandwa." Mukuma, mana mathadi meni malungila.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Balonguki bazimbudi: «Ah Pfumu, tala zazi mbedi zodi.» Amana yandi wubavutwadi: «Zazina zifwani.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambidi ku mongu wa ba Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mth 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Bwosu kálubuka, hanga wénda ku mongu wa ba Olive, bwosu buna kayikana. Balonguki bandi bamulandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Buna katula homa meni hana, wubazimbwadi: «Lombilenu, ndangu lubwaku mu phukumunu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Kunima, wádihambula kwena bawu kitesu kya thambi makumatatu. Amana bwosu kafukama, wáyandika phi kulombila, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>mu kuzimbula: «Tata, yuka ni wuzodi, thinisina kyana mbungu yayi. Kaasi ka luzolu ku lwa meni, yambula luzolu lwaku lwahangama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Hanga wanzyo mosi wátuka ku zilu, wumulubwakidi, ndangu kamuheka kikesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Yesu wuyuki kiwayi kya lawu, kahanga wusi hika ngolu mu kulombila. Kyusa kyandi kiyandiki kuhoma muna mafu hanga matonzi ma menga.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Buna katelama mu lombilu, wávutukisa kuna bakala balonguki, wubawani baleka kikuma kya kyadi kina bákala kyawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Abweti lubati leka buna? Tokamenu, lombilenu phi ndangu lubwaku mu phukumunu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamukwati Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mth 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Ywn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Buna kakala zonza bwana, kibuka kya batu kitudi. Yutasi wuna wákala ha kati dya bawu Kumi yi bodi, yandi wakala natisakya. Wábwesuka kwena Yesu mu kumuyamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Kaasi Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Yutasi, mu kuyamba wuzodi wamutekisila Mwana wa mutu?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Buna bámona mana mázola kubwa, bana bakala yi yandi bamuhyudini: «Pfumu, tufwani mu kubeta yi mbedi?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Amana, mosi wa bawu, wubeti musadi mosi wa bambuta ba banganga Nzambi amana wámuhuta kutu dya kitata. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Kaasi Yesu wuzimbudi: «Yambulenu, bwana bufwani.» Kunima wusimbi kutu dya mutu wuna, wumubeludi phi. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Kunima, hanga Yesu wuzimbudi kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi kwena pfumu wa batsinzidi ba nzu ya Nzambi yi bambuta ba dibundu bana bisa mukwata: «Lwisi ndatina mbedi yi miti hanga mbedi yena ndwandwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Bilumbu byosu khadiki yi benu mu nzu ya Nzambi, amana lwásandaku ni lwakhwata. Kaasi tangwa dyadi dyena dya benu yi ngolu za phipha.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wumutuni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mth 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Ywn 18:12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Kunima dya kumukwata, bamunati, bamukotisi phi mu nzu ya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. Phetelu kakala landa muna kyana. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Hanga balemisi mbawu mu kati dya kyanzala amana bazakadi. Phetelu wendi zakala hana kati dya bawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Musadi mosi wa mukhetu wumumoni kuna kyesesi kya mbawu, wumusimbuludi yi kiswiswiswi, wuzimbudi: «Yandu phi kákadiki yi yandi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Kaasi Phetelu wutuni, wuzonzi phi: «Mukhetu, yimuzayiku!» <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Kunima dya koma ka tangwa, mutu wahika wumumoni amana wuzimbudi hika: «Ngeyi phi wena mosi hana kati dya bawu!» Kaasi Phetelu wumuvutwadi: «Loni, ka meni ku!» <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ku nima dya tangwa dimosi, mutu mosi wahika wumuzimbwadi yi singu dyosu: «Mu kyedika, mutu yandu phi kákadiki yi yandi mukuma mwisi Ngadidi kenina yandi phi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Kaasi Phetelu wuvutudi: «Buna wubati zola kuzonza, nzayibwoku meni.» Muna tangwa meni dina kákala zonza, khoku wákokula. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Hanga Pfumu wábaluka amana wámutala Phetelu, hana Phetelu wuyubuki ndinga yina kámuzimbwala Pfumu: «Khoku kakókulaku kedi, lelu, ngeyi wathúna mbala tatu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Hanga Phetelu wálubuka, amana wádihonda kudila.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamutukwani, bamubeti phi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mth 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Bayakala bana bakala mutadikila Yesu, bakala museya yi kumubetaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bakala mufidinga mbunzu, mu kumuhyula: «Bikuleti, nati wukubeti?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Amana bákala mutukwana yi kumutangaka mambu ma mbi ma mutindu yi mutindu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala kibuka kya mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mth 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Ywn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Buna kwakhyela kuma, bambuta ba Bayuta, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku bákutakana. Bamunatisi Yesu ku thwala kimvuka kya mbuta kya Bayuta <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>amana bazimbudi: «Yukani ngeyi wena Masiya, tuzimbwalabwa.» Yandi wubavutwadi: «Yukani yiluzimbwalabwa, lwakúmbwalabwoku. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Amana yukani yiluhyula kyufu, lwamvútwalaku. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Kaasi tuka buthwena, Mwana wa mutu kasíkuka kuna kitata dya ngolu za Nzambi wa Phungu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Boosu bazimbudi: «Kisongidila, ngeyi Mwana wa Nzambi wena?» Yandi wubavutwadi: «Benu-benu luzimbudibwa ni yeninabwa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Hanga bawu bazimbudi: «Ni mupfunu wa bimbangi hika thwena wawu betu? Tumuyuki betu-betu muna munwa wandi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala Philatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mth 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ywn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Bátelama boosu ha kimosi amana bámunata ku thwala Philatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Báyandika kumufunda mu kuzimbula: «Tumuwani mutu yandu, kabati hukumuna batu ba betu; kabati bazimbwala ni bafutaku phaku kwena pfumu wa mbuta Khayisala, wudikitudi yandi meni Masiya, thotila.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Philatu wumuyufudi: «Ngeyi, pfumu wa Bayuta wenina?» Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Ngeyi meni wuzimbudibwa.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Hanga Philatu wuzimbudi kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi milumba-lumba mya batu: «Mboniku kima kya muzengila ndola mutu yandu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Kaasi bawu balaphikisi ndinga, bazimbudi phi: «Khabu kabati heka batu mu kulonga mu Yuteya dyosu, tuka ku Ngadidi, kuna káyandikila, yi kwaku.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala Eloti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Tangwa káyuka Philatu mambu mana, wuhyudi: «Mutu yandu, mwisi Ngadidi kenina?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Buna káyuka ni Yesu ku kinzunga kina kakala yala Eloti kátuka, kahanga wumuhitiki kwena yandi, mukuma ku Yelusalemi kákala muna bilumbu meni bina. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Amana Eloti buna kámona Yesu hanga kyesi kimukwati lawu. Kikuma, kakala sanda ni kamumona tuka thama; mukuma kázola kamumona kikuma kya mambu mana kakala yuka kuzonzila kikuma kya yandi, amana kákala yi kivuvu kya kumumona kusala ndambu ya biphadi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Kahanga wumuhyudi byufu bya lawu kaasi Yesu kámuvutwalaku keti kima. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku hana bákala amana bakala mufunda ngolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Hanga Eloti yi batsinzidi bandi, wuyandiki kumulewula. Amana kunima kumuseya yi kumuvwatisa muledi wumosi wa kitoku, hanga wumuhitiki hika kwena Philatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Muna kilumbu meni kina, Eloti yi Philatu bakítuka banduku, bawu batekila kala bambeni.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamuzengidi lufwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mth 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Ywn 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Philatu wákhokisa bambuta ba banganga Nzambi, bathwadisi yi batu bahika, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>hanga wubazimbwadi: «Benu lwisi ndatina mutu yandu, mu kuzonza ni batu kabati hukumuna. Kinga meni yimuhyudi ku thwala benu boosu kaasi mboniku kima mwena yandi kifwani muzengila ndola, ka kikuma ku muna mamana lubati mufundila. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Eloti phi, lo kwandi, mukuma wutulambwadi yandi hika. Kahangiku kima kifwani bamuhondila. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Yimusula, kunima dya kumubetisa fimbu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Kosu mukinzi wa Phaki, Philatu kafwana kubalubwala mutu mosi mu boloku.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Kaasi báyandika kukalunga boosu: «Muhonda mutu yandu, tulubwala Balabasi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balabasi, bámusila mu boloku kikuma kya mvwalangani yina bábusila bisi Loma, yina yáluta mu mbanza yi buna káhonda mutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Hanga Philatu wázonza hika mbala yikwawu, mukuma kázola kalubula Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Kaasi bawu bakala kalunga: «Mukhoka ha kitakani! Mukhoka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Philatu wubazimbwadi mu mbala ya tatu: «Khi mbi kasadi mutu yandu? Mboniku kima mwena yandi kilungi kumunatina lufwa. Yimusula, ku nima dya kumubetisa fimbu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Kaasi bakalungi hika ngolu, mu kulomba ni Yesu kakhokama ha kitakani. Hanga malokosi ma bawu mábanungisa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Philatu wubongi lukanu lwa kubasadila bwosu buna bakala lomba. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Wuyambwadidi wuna bákwata mu boloku kikuma kya mvwalangani yi buna káhonda mutu, wuna bakala lomba. Wubalambwadi Yesu ndangu bamuhanga buna bázola.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamukhoki ha kitakani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mth 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ywn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Bwosu bakala munata Yesu, bakwati mutu mosi zina dyandi Simoni, mwisi Sileni, wátuka ku bilanga. Hanga bamukwati ndangu kamunatisa Yesu kitakani kuna manima. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu wakala mulanda yi bakhetu mu bidilu yi miyananu mya lawu kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Hanga Yesu wubaluki kwena bakhetu wubazimbwadi: «Bakhetu ba ku Yelusalemi, ludilaku kikuma kya meni! Kaasi dilenu kikuma kya benu-benu yi kikuma kya bana benu! <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Mukuma bilumbu byakwísa, bina bazímbula: "Kyesi kwena bakhobu, kyesi kwena makundu mana mábutaku yi mayeni mana máyemikaku!" <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Hanga batu báyandika kuzimbula kwena mongu mya mbuta: "Tubwilenu" yi kwena mina mya khunda: "Tufidingenu!" <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Mukuma, yukani bahanga bwabu kwena miti wa tsi amana miti waloka abweti bahángawa?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Bakala nata muna tangwa medina bayakala bodi bahika bákala bandwandwa ndangu babahonda ha kimosi yi yandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Buna bátula homa hana bisi tela: «Kibelengenzi kya mutwa», bamukhoki Yesu ha kitakani; phila mosi yi bandwandwa bana, mosi ku koku dya kitata, mukwawu, ku koku dya kimama. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>[Yesu kakala zimbula: «Tata, balolula mukuma bazayimoku mana babati sala.»] Basanzani miledi myandi mu kubetilamya phi zeki. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Batu batelamiki hakana yi kutalaka mambu buna makala luta. Bapfumu ba Bayuta báyandika kumuseya, mu kuzimbula: «Batu bahika kakala hulula, kadihulula phi yandi meni yuka yandi kena Masiya wa Nzambi, wuna kásola!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Basuta phi bakala museya; babwesuki, bamunwisi phi vinu dya ngani, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>yi kuzimbulaka: «Yukani ngeyi pfumu wa Bayuta wena, dihulula ngeyi meni!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ha thandu ya mutwa wandi hákala yi bisona byabi: «Yandu kenina pfumu wa Bayuta.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mosi wa bandwandwa bana bákala ha kitakani, hanga wumutukwani mu kuzimbula: «Ka ngeyi ku Masiya? Dihulula ngeyi meni, amana watuhulula betu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kaasi mukwawu, wumusongisi, mu kuzimbula: «Weku yi bweya bwa Nzambi? Ngeyi wubongi ndola mosi yi yandi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Betu, ndola yayi yifwanani yi mbi yina twasadi kaasi yandu kasadiku kima kya mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Amana kakala zimbula: «Yesu, ngyubuka bawu tangwa wakwísa mu Kipfumu kyaku.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Yikuzimbwadibwa, mu kyedika: lelu dyadi, wakála yi meni muna Phaladisu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mth 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ywn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Amana tangwa ha kátula ha kisosi, kuma kwabwa phipha mu mulambu wosu yi kuna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Tangwa wátota. Muledi wa kikumbu kya nzu ya Nzambi wáyatuka ha kati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu wákalunga: «Tata, mvutudi moya wama mu moku maku.» Kunima kuzonza bwabuna, wutabudi. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mu kumona mana maluta, hanga satudiyoni wázatula Nzambi mu kuzimbula: «Mu kyedika, mutu yandu kákadiki mutu wasungama!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu bakala hana, bisa tala mambu buna máhitila, ku nima kumona mana máhita, bávutuka yi kudibundaka thulu kikuma kya kiwayi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Boosu bana bámuzaya, yi bakhetu bana bisa musindikila tuka ku Ngadidi, bátelama muna kyana ndangu bamona mambu buna makala luta.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukulumuni mu mazyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mth 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Hákala yi mutu mosi wa kimvuka kya bukheti, khumbu yandi Yozefu, mutu wa mboti yi wasungama. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Yandi kátambwasalwoku lukanu luna bátambula mu kimvuka yi bakwawu, kákala mwisi Adimate mbanza ya Bayuta, amana kakala hingila Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Kahanga wenda kwena Philatu amana wálomba lutu lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Wutuludilwa ha kitakani, wuvungilwa ha muledi, wusikudilwa phi mu mazyamu ma kitadi mana bakonda zika kedi mutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Kyákala kilumbu kya kuyilama, amana sabata dyázola kuyandika. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Bakhetu bana meni bámusindikila tuka ku Ngadidi, bakala landila, bámona mazyamu yi phila yina básikula lutu lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Amana kunima, bávutuka mu kuyidika masi yi mananasi kikuma kya mvumbi. Amana mu kilumbu kya Sabata, bálembwa bwosu buna wakala lomba mutsiku.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufutumuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mth 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ywn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Kilumbu kya theti kya phosa, bakhetu bénda ku mazyamu muna suka-suka, mu kunata mananasi mana báyidika. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Bawani ditadi dyakubundumuna ku thwala mazyamu; <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>bákota, kaasi báwanalwoku lutu lwa Pfumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Bwosu bákala mu kitswi kikuma kya mambu meni mana; batu bodi bámonika hakana, bavwatiki miledi myákala kédyamina. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Bwosu bákala yi bweya, bázenzika mbunzu muna mafu; kaasi batu bana babazimbwadi: «Kikuma kya biki lwisi sosila mutu wena mu luzingu mu kati dya bafwa? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Keku haka, kaasi wufutumuki. Banzenu buna kázimbula kwena benu ha kákala hika ku Ngadidi: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Bulungi, Mwana wa mutu bamulambula kwena basumuki amana kakhokama ha kitakani, amana kafútumuka mu kilumbu kya tatu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Amana báyubuka ndinga meni zina. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Bakhetu bákatuka ku mazyamu, kikuma kya kuyadingisa mana mosu kwena Bawu kumi yi mosi yi kwena bakwawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Hákala yi Madiya mwisi Makatala yi Zyani yi Madiya ngudi wa Zyaki. Bakhetu bahika phi bákala hakana, bazimbudibwa kwena bathumwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Kaasi ndinga zina bámonaza hanga zina za bilawu bákwikilaku kwena bakhetu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Kaasi Phetelu wátelama, wénda thinu ku mazyamu; amana buna kazenzama, wumoni lwesi bitemba bya miledi bya khatu. Amana wávutuka ku nzu yandi, wuyituki lawu kikuma kya mambu mana maluta.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu nzila Emawusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Kinga, muna kilumbu mekyana, boodi hana kati dya balonguki, bakala kwenda ku hata dimosi khumbu ya dyawu: Emawusu; tuka Yelusalemi yi kuna, bafwana kusala tangwa zodi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Muna nzila, bekazonzila mambu mana moosu buna málutila. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Tangwa bakala zonza yi kuyambilaka bwabuna, yameni Yesu wábawana, wénda nzila mosi yi bawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Kaasi mesu ma bawu máfwanaku mu kumusengumuna. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Hanga wubahyudi: «Biki lubati zonzila mu nzila?» Hanga batelami yi kyadi kyosu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Mosi hana kati dya bawu, khumbu yandi Kolofasi, wumuvutwadi: «Ngeyi lwesi wunangi bilumbu ku Yelusalemi, wukondi zaya mambu mana málutiki mu bilumbu byabi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yandi wáhyula: «Khi dyambu?» Hanga bamuvutwadini: «Mambu mana matadidi Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, wuna wakadi mbikudi wa ngolu mu bisalu yi ndinga zandi ku mesu ma Nzambi yi ku mesu ma batu boosu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bapfumu betu bamulambudi ndangu kafwa amana bamukhoki ha kitakani. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Twakadi yi kivuvu ni yandi wálubula mu kihika Kiseledi. Kaasi bilumbu byekina bitatu, tuka buna mabwidiki mambu mana. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Mu kyedika, bakhetu bahika hana kati dya betu batuyitwakisi. Lelu, bendiki muna suka ku mazyamu <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>kaasi bwosu bamoniyoku mvumbi yandi, bisi zimbula ni banzyo babalubwakidi, amana babaheki tsikiningi ni mu luzingu kenina. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Batu bahika ha kati dya betu bendiki ku mazyamu, bamoni mambu bwosu buna bazimbudiki bakhetu, kaasi yandi bamumonikiku.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Batu bakonda ngangu, mbundu zenu zisiku lenga kwikila mambu mana básamuna bambikudi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Bwáfwanaku ni Masiya kanyokuka bwabuna ku thwala kukota mu khembu yandi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Wábatendwala mambu moosu mana mamutadidi muna masonuku moosu, tuka ku mikanda mya Moyize yi kuna mikanda mya bambikudi boosu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Buna bátula ku hata dina bakala kwenda, Yesu wuhangi hanga mutu wuzodi kuluta. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Kaasi bawu bamubokwadidi mu kuzimbula: «Zakala yi betu; kuma kuyidini, phipa yekina bwa.» Hanga yandi wendi zakala yi bawu muna nzu yina bákota. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Yesu wázakala<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Disongidila ni wazenzama kakala. </char></note> kuna mesa ha kimosi yi bawu; wátambula dipha, wusambudidya; kunima, wábukunadya amana wábahekadya. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Hanga mesu ma bawu makanguki, bawu bamutunguludi kaasi yandi wátota hana kati dya bawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Amana báyandika kudizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Abweti yikondi tuphumwakina mbundu hanga mbawu, tangwa kakatuzonzisaka mu nzila yi kututendwala masonuku?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Hanga bátelama muna tangwa meni dina, bávutuka phi ku Yelusalemi. Bawani bawu kumi yi mosi mu kimvuka yi banduku ba bawu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>beka zimbula: «Mukyedika Pfumu wufutumuki! Mukuma kadimonikisi kwena Simoni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Hanga balonguki bana bawu bodi babatendwadi mana mábalutila mu nzila mu tangwa bakala kwenda yi buna kadisengumuna Yesu kwena bawu mu tangwa dya kubukuna dipha.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisengumuni kwena balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mth 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ywn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mhb 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Buna bakala zimbula bwabuna, hanga yandi meni Yesu wubalubwakidi, wátelama hana kati dya bawu amana wubazimbwadi: «Ngemba yakala yi benu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Bweya bubakwati balonguki, bayandiki phi kubanga lawu, kikuma bámona hanga kiphedikisa. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Kaasi yandi wubazimbwadi: «Bweya bwa biki lwena bwawu? Biki lubati findila phaka muna mbundu zenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Talenu moku yi malu mama: mu kyedika, meni yandu; babatenu lutu lwama, talenu phi; kiphedikisa kisiku kala yi musuni keti mufufwa; bwosu lubati mona yenina byawu.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Buna kázimbula bwabuna, hanga wubasongidi moku mandi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabasongilama ndangu bakwikila ni yandi kyedika. </char></note> yi malu mandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bwosu kyábalutila kyesi, bafwanaku kedi kukwikila, mu kuyituka bákala. Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Kima kya kudya lwena kyawu haka?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bámuheka kitini kya tsema wa kukadinga. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Wutambudikya amana wudikya phi muna mesu ma bawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Hanga wubazimbwadi hika: «Tagwa yikala theti ha kimosi yi benu, yikala luzimbwala ni mana básonika kikuma kya meni, mu mitsiku mya Moyize, mu mikanda mya bambikudi yi mu mikunga, mafwana masalama.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Hanga yandi wubakangudi mabanza ndangu babakisa masonuku, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>amana wubazimwadi: «Básonika bwabu ni Masiya kanyókuka, amana kafútumuka ku tsi ya bafwa mu kilumbu kya tatu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>bufwani bayandikila ku Yelusalemi, mu kulonga malongi mu khumbu ya yandi; kusamuna kwena batu ba tsi ni basoba bikalulu ndangu babonga ndoluka ya masumu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Benu lwenina bambangi ba mambu mana. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Amana meni phitiki kwena benu, kina kásila Tata wama. Benu, zakalenu mu mbanza tii yikuna lwavwátila ngolu za ku zilu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wendi ku zilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mhb 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Amana, Yesu wábalubula mu mbanza, wábanata tii yi kuna bela-bela yi hata dya Betaniya, Hanga wátombula moku ku zilu, wubasambudi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Buna kakala basambula, wudihambudi yi bawu amana bámutombula ku zilu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Bawu kunima dya kufukama ku thwala yandi, bávutuka phi ku Yelusalemi yi kyesi kya lawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Bilumbu byosu bakala kutakana mu nzu ya Nzambi yi kukumisaka Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
